  <data key="d0">{"name":"Individual Term Life Insurance Policy","text":"===== Page 1 =====\nEquivita Mutual Life Insurance \nCompany INDIVIDUAL LEVEL TERM LIFE INSURANCE \nPOLICY  \nPolicy Number: EML-2025-00028391  \nIssue Date: August 1, 2025  \nPolicy Owner: Jordan Ellis  \nInsured Person: Jordan Ellis  \nBeneficiary: Taylor Ellis (Spouse)  \nFace Amount: $500,000  \nPolicy Type: 20-Year Level Term  \nThis is a legal contract between the Policy Owner and Equivita Mutual Life Insurance \nCompany. The Company agrees to provide the insurance described in this Policy, subject to \nthe terms and conditions contained herein.  \nSigned for the Company at its Home Office in New York, NY.  \n__________________________  \nChief Executive Officer  \n__________________________  \nSecretary\n\n===== Page 2 =====\nPolicy Specifications  \nPolicy Number: EML-2025-00028391  \nIssue Date : August 1, 2025  \nPolicy Owner : Jordan Ellis  \nInsured Person : Jordan Ellis \nDate of Birth : March 15, 1990  \nSex  : Male  \nRisk Class : Standard Non-Smoker  \nPolicy Type : 20-Year Level Term  \nCoverage Term : August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045  \nFace Amount : $500,000 \n \nAnnual Premium:  \n$420 \nPremium Mode: Annual \nGrace Period  \n31 Days  \nBeneficiary  \nTaylor Ellis (Spouse)  \nGoverning Law \nState of New York\n\n===== Page 3 =====\nDefinitions \n \nPolicy  \nThis legal agreement, including the application, declarations, riders, and any endorsements issued by the Company.  \n​\nCompany  \nEquivita Mutual Life Insurance Company.  \nInsured  \nThe individual named on the Policy Specifications as the Insured Person.  \nPolicy Owner  \nThe person who owns and controls all rights under this Policy.  \nBeneficiary  \nThe person(s) designated to receive the death benefit proceeds upon the death of the Insured.  \nFace Amount  \nThe amount payable upon the death of the Insured, as shown in the Policy Specifications.  \nPremium : The amount the Policy Owner must pay to keep this Policy in force.  \nPolicy Anniversary : Each yearly anniversary of the Policy's Issue Date.","summary":"This is an individual level term life insurance policy issued by Equivita Mutual Life Insurance Company to Jordan Ellis, with a face amount of $500,000 and a 20-year coverage period running from August 1, 2025, to July 31, 2045. The annual premium is $420 paid annually, with a 31-day grace period; the beneficiary is Taylor Ellis, spouse. Key terms include risk class (Standard Non-Smoker), governing law (New York State), and defined policy components like premiums, policy anniversaries, and benefits.","topics":["Life Insurance","Term Coverage","Policy Terms","Death Benefit"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification Number","sentence":"The policy number is EML-2025-00028391.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy number","identification","document reference"],"entities":[{"name":"Equivita Mutual Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of the policy","relational_anchors":["Policy Number: EML-2025-00028391"]},{"name":"Jordan Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person and policy owner","relational_anchors":["Policy Owner: Jordan Ellis","Insured Person: Jordan Ellis","Date of Birth: March 15, 1990","Sex: Male","Risk Class: Standard Non-Smoker"]},{"name":"Taylor Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Beneficiary: Taylor Ellis (Spouse)"]},{"name":"August 1, 2025","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of the policy","relational_anchors":["Issue Date: August 1, 2025","Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"July 31, 2045","type":"DATE","role":"end date of coverage term","relational_anchors":["Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"20-Year Level Term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"type of policy coverage","relational_anchors":["Policy Type: 20-Year Level Term"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Face Amount: $500,000"]},{"name":"$420","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium amount","relational_anchors":["Annual Premium: $420"]},{"name":"New York, NY","type":"LOCATION","role":"location of company home office","relational_anchors":["Home Office in New York, NY"]},{"name":"Policy","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal agreement encompassing entire contract","relational_anchors":["This legal agreement, including the application, declarations, riders...","Policy Number: EML-2025-00028391"]}]},{"name":"Policy Issue Date","sentence":"The issue date of the policy is August 1, 2025.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Issue Date","Effective Coverage Start","Policy Anniversary"],"entities":[{"name":"Equivita Mutual Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of the policy","relational_anchors":["Policy Number: EML-2025-00028391"]},{"name":"Jordan Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person and policy owner","relational_anchors":["Policy Owner: Jordan Ellis","Insured Person: Jordan Ellis","Date of Birth: March 15, 1990","Sex: Male","Risk Class: Standard Non-Smoker"]},{"name":"Taylor Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Beneficiary: Taylor Ellis (Spouse)"]},{"name":"August 1, 2025","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of the policy","relational_anchors":["Issue Date: August 1, 2025","Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"July 31, 2045","type":"DATE","role":"end date of coverage term","relational_anchors":["Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"20-Year Level Term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"type of policy coverage","relational_anchors":["Policy Type: 20-Year Level Term"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Face Amount: $500,000"]},{"name":"$420","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium amount","relational_anchors":["Annual Premium: $420"]},{"name":"New York, NY","type":"LOCATION","role":"location of company home office","relational_anchors":["Home Office in New York, NY"]},{"name":"Policy","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal agreement encompassing entire contract","relational_anchors":["This legal agreement, including the application, declarations, riders...","Policy Number: EML-2025-00028391"]}]},{"name":"Policy Owner Identity","sentence":"The policy owner is Jordan Ellis.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Owner","Jordan Ellis","Ownership Rights"],"entities":[{"name":"Equivita Mutual Life Insurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer of the policy","relational_anchors":["Policy Number: EML-2025-00028391"]},{"name":"Jordan Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person and policy owner","relational_anchors":["Policy Owner: Jordan Ellis","Insured Person: Jordan Ellis","Date of Birth: March 15, 1990","Sex: Male","Risk Class: Standard Non-Smoker"]},{"name":"Taylor Ellis","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Beneficiary: Taylor Ellis (Spouse)"]},{"name":"August 1, 2025","type":"DATE","role":"issue date of the policy","relational_anchors":["Issue Date: August 1, 2025","Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"July 31, 2045","type":"DATE","role":"end date of coverage term","relational_anchors":["Coverage Term: August 1, 2025 to July 31, 2045"]},{"name":"20-Year Level Term","type":"CONCEPT","role":"type of policy coverage","relational_anchors":["Policy Type: 20-Year Level Term"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of death benefit","relational_anchors":["Face Amount: $500,000"]},{"name":"$420","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual premium amount","relational_anchors":["Annual Premium: $420"]},{"name":"New York, NY","type":"LOCATION","role":"location of company home office","relational_anchors":["Home Office in New York, NY"]},{"name":"Policy","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal agreement encompassing entire contract","relational_anchors":["This legal agreement, including th