<node id="67dd3707-bf2e-43c9-97d3-4d0af0400af0">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Key Insurance Policy Provisions","text":"  \nThe amount payable upon the death of the Insured, as shown in the Policy Specifications.  \nPremium : The amount the Policy Owner must pay to keep this Policy in force.  \nPolicy Anniversary : Each yearly anniversary of the Policy's Issue Date.  \nGrace Period  : A 31-day period after a premium due date during which the Policy remains in force.  \nLapse \nThe termination of the Policy due to nonpayment of premiums after the grace period.  \nReinstatement  \nThe process of restoring a lapsed Policy to active status as outlined in this Policy.  \nIncontestability Period : A two-year period during which the Company may contest the validity of the Policy.  \nSuicide Exclusion Period: A two-year period during which the death benefit is limited if the Insured dies by \nsuicide.\n\n===== Page 4 =====\nGeneral Provisions \nEntire Contract  \nThis Policy, together with the attached application, any supplemental applications, riders, endorsements, and \namendments issued by the Company, constitutes the entire contract. All statements made by the Insured or the \nPolicy Owner shall, in the absence of fraud, be deemed representations and not warranties. No statement shall be \nused in defense of a claim under this Policy unless it is contained in the written application and a copy of such \napplication is attached to the Policy at issue.  \nModifications  \nNo change or modification to this Policy shall be valid unless approved in writing by an executive officer of the \nCompany. No agent, producer, or field representative has authority to alter or waive any provision of this Policy or \nto extend the time for payment of premiums. Any statutory or regulatory change mandated by governing law shall \nbe incorporated into this Policy automatically as required, with or without notice to the Policy Owner.  \nMisstatement of Age or Sex  \nIf the age or sex of the Insured has been misstated, the amount of the death benefit payable under this Policy \nshall be the amount the premium paid would have purchased at the correct age and sex. If the correction results in \nan overpayment of premiums, the Company shall refund the excess to the Policy Owner without interest. If the \ncorrection results in an underpayment of premiums, the death benefit shall be reduced accordingly. If the Insured \nis found to be outside of an insurable age range at issue, the Policy shall be void ab initio and all premiums shall \nbe refunded.  \nAssignment  \nThe Policy Owner","summary":"This document outlines essential definitions and general provisions of an insurance policy, covering critical elements like the death benefit, premium payments, grace periods, lapses, reinstatement, and important exclusions such as the incontestability and suicide clauses. It specifies that the full contract includes the policy, application, and amendments, and no changes can take effect without written approval. Misstatements about age or sex impact the death benefit proportionally, while incorrect eligibility leads to policy nullification and refunds.","topics":["Insurance Terms","Policy Provisions","Death Benefit","Contractual Clauses"],"facts":[{"name":"Death Benefit Amount Specification","sentence":"The amount payable upon the death of the Insured is specified in the Policy Specifications.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["death benefit","policy specifications","insured payout"],"entities":[{"name":"Amount Payable Upon Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"death benefit calculation basis","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"financial obligation to maintain coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"annual renewal milestone","relational_anchors":["yearly"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"post-due-date continuation window","relational_anchors":["31-day"]},{"name":"Lapse","type":"EVENT","role":"termination due to missed payments","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Reinstatement","type":"PROCESS","role":"restoration of inactive policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Incontestability Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for company challenge","relational_anchors":["two-year"]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"restricted payout duration post-suicide","relational_anchors":["two-year"]},{"name":"Entire Contract","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal scope of binding agreement","relational_anchors":["attached application","riders","endorsements","amendments"]},{"name":"Representations","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-warranty factual claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Warranties","type":"CONCEPT","role":"binding guarantees excluded here","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Modifications","type":"PROVISION","role":"change authorization rule","relational_anchors":["approved in writing by an executive officer"]},{"name":"Agent","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Producer","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Field Representative","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Misstatement of Age or Sex","type":"CONDITION","role":"adjustment trigger for benefits","relational_anchors":["correct age and sex","overpayment of premiums","underpayment of premiums","insurable age range"]},{"name":"Void ab initio","type":"STATUS","role":"automatic invalidation condition","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Assignment","type":"ACTION","role":"transfer of ownership rights","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Premium Payment Obligation","sentence":"The Premium is the amount the Policy Owner must pay to keep this Policy in force.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Premium","Policy Maintenance","Payment Requirement"],"entities":[{"name":"Amount Payable Upon Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"death benefit calculation basis","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"financial obligation to maintain coverage","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"annual renewal milestone","relational_anchors":["yearly"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"post-due-date continuation window","relational_anchors":["31-day"]},{"name":"Lapse","type":"EVENT","role":"termination due to missed payments","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Reinstatement","type":"PROCESS","role":"restoration of inactive policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Incontestability Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for company challenge","relational_anchors":["two-year"]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion Period","type":"PERIOD","role":"restricted payout duration post-suicide","relational_anchors":["two-year"]},{"name":"Entire Contract","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"legal scope of binding agreement","relational_anchors":["attached application","riders","endorsements","amendments"]},{"name":"Representations","type":"CONCEPT","role":"non-warranty factual claims","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Warranties","type":"CONCEPT","role":"binding guarantees excluded here","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Modifications","type":"PROVISION","role":"change authorization rule","relational_anchors":["approved in writing by an executive officer"]},{"name":"Agent","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Producer","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Field Representative","type":"ROLE","role":"unauthorized modifier of policy terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Misstatement of Age or Sex","type":"CONDITION","role":"adjustment trigger for benefits","relational_anchors":["correct age and sex","overpayment of premiums","underpayment of premiums","insurable age range"]},{"name":"Void ab initio","type":"STATUS","role":"automatic invalidation condition","relational_anchors