<node id="b3c41132-ee1f-4a8c-bf0d-532c6e20f785">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Beneficiary Rules &amp; Death Distribution","text":"iciaries and Simultaneous Death  \nIf no designated Beneficiary survives the Insured, proceeds will be paid to the \nContingent Beneficiary, if any. If no Contingent Beneficiary survives, proceeds will be \npayable to the Policy Owner’s estate. In the event the Insured and the Beneficiary die \nsimultaneously or  \nunder circumstances rendering the order of death uncertain, the Company shall assume \nthe Beneficiary predeceased the Insured unless otherwise governed by state law.\n\n===== Page 7 =====\nBeneficiary Provisions  \nDesignation of Beneficiary  \nThe Beneficiary is the person or persons designated by the Policy Owner to receive the death \nbenefit upon the death of the Insured. The designation must be made in writing and filed with \nthe Company. If multiple Beneficiaries are named, and no distribution percentages are \nspecified, proceeds will be paid in equal shares.  \nChange of Beneficiary  \nUnless an irrevocable Beneficiary has been designated, the Policy Owner may change the \nBeneficiary at any time during the lifetime of the Insured by written request satisfactory to the \nCompany. A change will take effect as of the date the request is signed, regardless of \nwhether the Insured is alive at the time the change is recorded by the Company.  \nIrrevocable Beneficiary  \nIf the Policy Owner names an irrevocable Beneficiary, the Policy Owner may not exercise \ncertain rights under the Policy—including changing the Beneficiary or assigning the \nPolicy—without the written consent of the irrevocable Beneficiary.  \nSimultaneous Death and Disclaimer  \nIf the Insured and the Beneficiary die under circumstances that make the order of death \nuncertain, the Beneficiary shall be presumed to have predeceased the Insured. A \nBeneficiary who disclaims proceeds shall be treated as having predeceased the Insured.  \nFacility of Payment  \nIf no Beneficiary survives the Insured, or if a Beneficiary cannot be located within 90 days \nof the Insured’s death, the Company may pay the proceeds to the Insured’s estate or to any \nperson deemed by the Company to be equitably entitled, including one who incurred \nexpenses related to the Insured’s last illness or burial. Such payment shall discharge the \nCompany’s liability to the extent of the amount paid.\n\n===== Page 8 =====\nContestability and Suicide Clause  \nIncontest","summary":"Life insurance policies specify how death benefits are distributed when the insured dies. If no surviving beneficiary exists, proceeds go to the contingent beneficiary, then to the policy owner's estate. In cases where the insured and beneficiary die simultaneously or their order of death is unclear, the beneficiary is legally presumed to have died first unless state law dictates otherwise. Beneficiaries can be changed unless they are irrevocable, which requires their consent. If no eligible beneficiary is found within 90 days, payments may be made to the estate or someone who incurred legitimate expenses related to the deceased’s final care or funeral.","topics":["Beneficiary Designation","Death Benefit Distribution","Simultaneous Death","Estate Settlement"],"facts":[{"name":"Beneficiary Definition","sentence":"The Beneficiary is the person or persons designated by the Policy Owner to receive the death benefit upon the death of the Insured.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary","Death Benefit","Policy Owner Designation"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Written Beneficiary Designation","sentence":"The designation of a Beneficiary must be made in writing and filed with the Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Designation","Writing Requirement","Filing with Company"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Equal Share Distribution Rule","sentence":"If multiple Beneficiaries are named and no distribution percentages are specified, proceeds will be paid in equal shares.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Multiple Beneficiaries","Equal Shares","Distribution Percentages"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Beneficiary Change Rights","sentence":"Unless an irrevocable Beneficiary has been designated, the Policy Owner may change the Beneficiary at any time during the lifetime of the Insured.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Change","Policy Owner Authority","Revocable Beneficiary"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Beneficiary Change Effective Date","sentence":"A change of Beneficiary takes effect as of the date the written request is signed.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Change","Effective Date","Written Request"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Change Effective Posthumously","sentence":"A change of Beneficiary is effective even if the Insured is dead when the change is recorded by the Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Beneficiary Change","Effective Date","Insured Dead"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary Consent Rule","sentence":"If an irrevocable Beneficiary is named, the Policy Owner may not change the Beneficiary without the written consent of the irrevocable Beneficiary.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["irrevocable beneficiary","change of beneficiary","written consent requirement"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary Consent","sentence":"If an irrevocable Beneficiary is named, the Policy Owner may not assign the Policy without the written consent of the irrevocable Beneficiary.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["irrevocable beneficiary","policy assignment","written consent"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["proceeds payable to estate","equal shares"]},{"name":"Simultaneous Death","type":"CONCEPT","role":"event where order of death is uncertain","relational_anchors":["assume the Beneficiary predeceased the Insured","presumed to have predeceased"]},{"name":"Irrevocable Beneficiary","type":"CONCEPT","role":"beneficiary whose consent required for changes","relational_anchors":["cannot be changed without written consent"]},{"name":"90 days","type":"DATE","role":"time limit for locating beneficiary","relational_anchors":["within 90 days of the Insured’s death"]}]},{"name":"Primary Beneficiary Failure","sentence":"If no designated Beneficiary survives the Insured, proceeds will be paid to the Contingent Beneficiary, if any.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["contingent beneficiary","survivorship rules","death benefit payout"],"entities":[{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"primary individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"recipient of death benefit","relational_anchors":["designated by the Policy Owner","disclaimer"]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary","type":"PERSON","role":"secondary recipient if primary dies first","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party who controls beneficiary designation","relational_anchors":["may change the Beneficiary","irrevocable Beneficiary requires consent"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"insurer administering benefits","relational_anchors":["filed with the Company","satisfactory to the Company","recorded by the Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors"