  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 defines the duration of the policy’s effectiveness, while fact sentence 2 identifies the state whose laws apply to the agreement. Together, they establish foundational parameters—timing and legal authority—for interpreting the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
