  <data key="d3">The policy’s coverage period spans twenty years, beginning August 1, 2025, and ending July 31, 2045. This timeframe is contingent upon timely premium payments, as defined by the policyholder’s obligation to keep the policy active.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
