  <data key="d3">The policy's coverage period spans from August 1, 2025, to July 31, 2045, and its progression is marked by annual milestones known as policy anniversaries, which align with the issue date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
