  <data key="d3">The policy's fixed coverage term sets the timeframe during which protection applies, while the clause about non-liability during lapses specifies exceptions to coverage even within that window if payments were missed.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
