  <data key="d3">The long-term coverage window established in fact_sentence_1 sets the stage for when reinstatement might occur, making the resumption of suicide exclusions relevant only within that timeframe.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
