  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the policy's effective dates, which operate under the legal authority specified in fact_sentence_2. The governance clause supports the validity and interpretation of the coverage timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
