  <data key="d3">The policy’s extended coverage period enables potential exercise of the conversion option before expiration, making it feasible to transition into permanent insurance while still covered.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
