  <data key="d3">The policy’s stated coverage period ends in 2045, but if it lapses before then due to missed payments, it can potentially be reinstated within five years after lapse, extending coverage past the original termination date.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional extension</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
