  <data key="d3">The long-term coverage window established in fact_sentence_1 depends on continued premium payments and potential reinstatement after lapses, which involves paying overdue amounts with interest as outlined in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6c0901ed-f52a-4ce9-9d52-9547016ca265" target="e7c4ba5d-2f8a-4bd9-8e77-4018f8285f7a">
  <data key="d3">The policy has a set end date of July 31, 2045, meaning any need for reinstatement would have occurred prior to this deadline. Evidence of insurability may be required if the policy lapses earlier due to missed payments during the coverage window.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
