  <data key="d3">A 31-day grace period allows for late premium payments without lapsing the policy, reinforcing the enforceability and operational framework of the underlying legal contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">related to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
