  <data key="d3">The existence of a 31-day grace period ensures that the insurer's commitment to provide coverage remains effective even if the premium is slightly delayed.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
