  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 describes the allowable delay in paying the premium, which applies specifically to the $420 annual payment mentioned in fact sentence 1, ensuring continuity of coverage if payment is delayed slightly.</data>
  <data key="d4">covers</data>
