  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 indicates a 31-day grace period following the annual premium due date, which directly depends on the annual premium mode established in fact sentence 1 to determine its applicability.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
