<edge source="e95a83d3-c700-45d5-abe2-2438276d3c5e" target="f132426a-4a89-442f-804e-9685b2a8370a">
  <data key="d3">Taylor Ellis, as the named beneficiary, would receive the policy proceeds if the policy remains active or is successfully reinstated after lapse. However, reinstatement depends on paying overdue premiums with interest, directly affecting whether she can collect.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
