<edge source="e95a83d3-c700-45d5-abe2-2438276d3c5e" target="45eb8281-3543-4e01-bd76-8cddd037b578">
  <data key="d3">Taylor Ellis, as the named beneficiary, will receive the death benefit less any unpaid premiums, meaning the policy's financial obligation to them depends on whether premiums were fully paid during the insured's lifetime.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
