  <data key="d3">Taylor Ellis being named as the primary beneficiary ensures that she receives the policy proceeds upon Jordan Ellis’s death, assuming she survives him—this aligns with the conditional rule stated in fact_sentence_2 about contingent beneficiaries only applying if no primary beneficiary survives.</data>
