  <data key="d3">The insured is legally defined as the person named in the Policy Specifications, which includes Jordan Ellis, whose date of birth is documented separately.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="abcb40ee-de9a-4039-a28a-20a1a7730e94" target="c48f7cf0-9d20-4c35-a7b2-17899178b5d2">
  <data key="d3">The definition of “insured” in the policy specifies the individual named in the Policy Specifications. This reference encompasses factual details such as gender, including the fact that the insured is male.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
