  <data key="d3">Since the insured is formally identified through the Policy Specifications—part of the declared terms—the clarity of the insured’s identity directly stems from the inclusion of those specifications among the policy documents listed in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
