  <data key="d3">The definition of the beneficiary aligns with how the policy document specifies beneficiaries, particularly within the declarations section and other official endorsements included in the full policy package.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined in</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="49ede6cd-0ba5-4ff3-af79-5ed128947216" target="5212d348-d044-4577-a3cb-cbdceb56d142">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the beneficiary as the recipient of death benefits is a core provision included within the broader legal framework of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
