<edge source="7363bacb-3824-48b8-b24a-eb9aac000329" target="b6c70d4a-bb66-4ce6-8a7e-fcce14499c75">
  <data key="d3">The face amount represents the payout upon death, contingent on maintaining the policy through timely premium payments, ensuring the benefit remains enforceable.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
