<edge source="7363bacb-3824-48b8-b24a-eb9aac000329" target="c7c925cb-8c15-4c3e-98c7-37dd24303a91">
  <data key="d3">The face amount specified in the policy may be adjusted downward if the insured’s sex was incorrectly stated, meaning the actual payout depends on recalculating the benefit based on the correct sex-based premium rate.</data>
