  <data key="d3">The face amount depends on continuous policy validity, which is maintained through the grace period allowing delayed premium payments without immediate lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7363bacb-3824-48b8-b24a-eb9aac000329" target="9aff7508-84dd-468d-83c6-658c086cf16c">
  <data key="d3">The face amount is only payable if the policy remains active, meaning it cannot be claimed if the policy lapses due to unpaid premiums after the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7363bacb-3824-48b8-b24a-eb9aac000329" target="b0682bc0-a0b2-4059-b458-c16bdb0d9fb4">
  <data key="d3">The face amount specified in the policy is subject to reduction or denial if the insured dies by suicide within the first two years, aligning with the stated exclusion clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional limitation</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7363bacb-3824-48b8-b24a-eb9aac000329" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">The face amount represents the key financial obligation of the insurer upon death, and reinstatement ensures that this benefit remains available even after a lapse due to missed premiums, preserving the integrity of the originally specified payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
