  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 serves as a practical instantiation of the abstract principles it defines, exemplifying how concepts like death benefits, premiums, and beneficiary designations manifest in a real-world policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
