  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on the implications of failing to pay premiums (grace period, lapse, reinstatement) and clarifies the process and conditions under which benefits are distributed after death, building on earlier mentions of policy termination and beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
