  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 strengthens chunk 1 by affirming the policy’s legal endurance—if any provision fails, others remain enforceable—and ensures that rights cannot be lost through silence, thereby protecting the structural integrity of the terms defined earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
