  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on the implications of reinstating a lapsed policy, clarifying that it triggers a fresh contestability period and reactivates exclusions, thus reinforcing the importance of timely renewal and compliance established earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
