<edge source="6b3e96fb-fdf8-41b4-8cb5-c43de3bff2e7" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period protects against future disputes over policy validity after two years, assuming premiums have been consistently paid. Premium adherence supports ongoing policy effectiveness, enabling the incontestability clock to run uninterrupted.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
