  <data key="d3">The incontestability period sets a timeframe after which the insurer cannot dispute the policy's validity due to misrepresentation, while the 31-day grace period ensures continued coverage despite delayed premium payments. Both contribute to stability and fairness in policy enforcement.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
