  <data key="d3">The completeness of the contract described in fact_sentence_1 is reinforced by fact_sentence_2’s severability clause, which ensures continuity of the agreement even if individual terms fail.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="474ef3ff-fa30-4661-8d2d-93b34f04b312" target="92a0c3fd-b6dc-4a3b-852d-2dde74d5850f">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 defines the scope of the binding contract, while fact_sentence_2 ensures that if any clause fails legally, the rest remains effective—complementing the completeness claim with legal robustness.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="474ef3ff-fa30-4661-8d2d-93b34f04b312" target="14d9f380-89b3-451f-94aa-1ef90e6286fa">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that the policy's full scope includes all official documents and modifications, which supports the assertion in fact_sentence_2 that it forms the complete agreement between the parties.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="474ef3ff-fa30-4661-8d2d-93b34f04b312" target="a2f514f9-483a-46e4-bd60-a528a1b42c8b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets the foundation that the policy is a complete contract requiring written agreements; fact_sentence_2 strengthens this by mandating written signatures for any waiver, ensuring consistency with the contract’s formal nature.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
