</edge>
<edge source="34477494-c07a-4a94-8d5d-9ab2d18efa69" target="474ef3ff-fa30-4661-8d2d-93b34f04b312">
  <data key="d3">Legal changes are automatically applied to maintain validity. This process relies on the foundational definition of the contract's composition outlined earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="34477494-c07a-4a94-8d5d-9ab2d18efa69" target="c39b37f1-33a3-4fd2-bedc-c257cc617eba">
  <data key="d3">Mandatory legal or regulatory changes override standard procedures requiring written executive approval, ensuring immediate alignment with new governance demands.</data>
  <data key="d4">supersedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="34477494-c07a-4a94-8d5d-9ab2d18efa69" target="9d18139a-0c83-4f90-b974-a4a7e8663000">
  <data key="d3">Legal requirements are enforced automatically, even if they contradict informal practices. This contrasts with the restriction that agents cannot alter terms, highlighting that statutory obligations supersede agency limitations.</data>
  <data key="d4">is superseding</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="34477494-c07a-4a94-8d5d-9ab2d18efa69" target="ce0fb1c9-347b-430e-a607-ea32da5c639f">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 states that legal changes are automatically included in the policy. Fact_sentence_2 elaborates that this inclusion happens without informing the policyholder, reinforcing the automatic nature of updates.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6d83cb70-56c7-4489-bbac-c597f8c9e370" target="34477494-c07a-4a94-8d5d-9ab2d18efa69">
