  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 extends its framework by introducing temporal safeguards—such as the contestability period and suicide clause—that limit liability despite adherence to initial policy terms, thereby constraining the unconditional nature of coverage described earlier.</data>
