<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="2940b504-0b37-4a43-8502-2feaeb5668ba">
  <data key="d3">A policy becomes void ab initio if the insured was outside the insurable age range at issue, which inherently implies that the death benefit would have been adjusted downward prior to such termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="fa85ef78-daa9-404e-b6ed-fccb52560244">
  <data key="d3">When the insured is found outside the insurable age range, the policy is declared invalid from inception. As a result, all paid premiums are fully refunded to maintain fairness under contract law.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="f16e49b5-127a-4da9-9b3d-98d87f3e061a">
  <data key="d3">If the insured is outside the insurable age range, the policy is void from the beginning, rendering any subsequent election of optional benefits impossible because the policy does not exist legally.</data>
  <data key="d4">precludes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">If the insured is outside the insurable age range, the policy is void from the beginning. Any action by the policy owner remains governed by the overall policy terms, including such voidance clauses.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinated to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="2b82244e-77bd-4daa-b86e-e3bfa2ef021f">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 reiterates the same condition as fact sentence 1—that the policy is void ab initio upon discovery of out-of-range age—and is supported by chunk summary 2's confirmation of voidance and refund under similar circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">identical to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="02c92a77-4444-4482-b5ba-6fbe3753537c" target="61440afb-3a2c-404a-bde6-11a9b541d36d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 declares the policy void from inception upon age ineligibility, which logically supports the requirement in fact_sentence_1 for full premium refunds, ensuring fairness in case of contractual invalidity.</data>
  <data key="d4">justifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
