  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 repeats the exact same clause as fact sentence 1 regarding refunds when the insured is outside the insurable age range, aligning directly with the core principle detailed in chunk summary 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">identical to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
