  <data key="d3">The requirement for written notice initiates the process that leads to the assignment becoming effective once received and recorded by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="4a4ca44e-1767-405f-8f6b-09fab8417798">
  <data key="d3">Sentence 1 specifies assignment of the entire Policy through written notice, which is encompassed within the broader right described in sentence 2 to assign any rights under the Policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="68b1219a-81cc-436d-b9fa-18329365fedb">
  <data key="d3">Providing written notice initiates the assignment process, after which the company explicitly avoids assuming responsibility for validating its legality.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="6e440086-23d0-4b7f-adcc-b2cb7b037991">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to assign the policy upon giving written notice, but the company reserves the right to determine whether the assignment meets its requirements without assuming responsibility for that determination.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="771de587-5b8c-4772-ae4a-1e306c16617f">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy through proper written notice can result in constraints on the exercisable rights associated with it.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="b42dc01b-3bad-4d3c-991a-41d5cb2909a4">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy requires written notice, but the assignee's rights remain secondary to any irrevocable beneficiary unless explicitly overridden in writing.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy through proper written notice may result in limitations on the exercisable rights associated with it, reflecting a consequence of the transfer.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="775ca55f-580f-4b78-8f96-9fb875dfd32a">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy via written notice triggers potential limitations on the policy owner’s rights, as stated in the subsequent clause about restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy requires the owner to have the right to act unilaterally, which is affirmed by the statement that the owner may exercise all rights while the insured is alive.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="74da563a-668e-4838-9c04-3edc34513cfb">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy via written notice is subject to any pre-existing limitations imposed by irrevocable beneficiary designations, ensuring such assignments cannot circumvent those protections.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinated to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="311330de-41eb-43d2-9f52-1faca7a7786e">
  <data key="d3">Assignment of the policy is permitted under the terms outlined in the clause, but only while the insured remains alive, ensuring continuity of ownership rights within defined boundaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">Assigning the policy via written notice creates legally binding obligations for all parties involved, ensuring consistency and accountability under the agreement.</data>
