  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="65b92887-6d9b-49f0-b4fb-6d971091d214">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="a055fa3b-df34-4799-b8c9-016199691767">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="1dc8aed7-01f9-4dda-8020-f6c1467ab05d">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="e8e80c97-a64f-4144-8f85-5bcb78b8bb64">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="aa9306a5-ae85-49e3-992f-6cc7c15e998e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="a2d2fa0d-4808-4e7b-a748-3b1fa11caa62">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da">
  <data key="d3">The act of assigning the policy requires formal notification and inherently carries implications, potentially restricting some rights held by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="4a4ca44e-1767-405f-8f6b-09fab8417798">
  <data key="d3">The ability to assign rights is conditional upon possible loss of control over specific policy entitlements, as assignments can restrict future use of those rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="a8967232-8d5a-44c6-bf5d-6fefc30ab80d">
  <data key="d3">The restriction of certain policy rights through an assignment arises only after the company has received and recorded the required written notice.</data>
  <data key="d4">preceded by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="68b1219a-81cc-436d-b9fa-18329365fedb">
  <data key="d3">Assignments that undermine the legitimacy of rights transfer may fail to hold up legally, leading the company to disclaim responsibility for such transfers.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="6e440086-23d0-4b7f-adcc-b2cb7b037991">
  <data key="d3">Since assignments may restrict key rights under the policy, it becomes necessary for the insurer to disclaim responsibility regarding whether those assignments are sufficient or effective.</data>
  <data key="d4">justifies disclamer</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="a72ae00e-3120-4673-b199-3e97fab66244">
  <data key="d3">Restrictions on policy rights due to assignment imply that individuals should consider potential tax liabilities associated with transferring those rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes tax risk</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.78</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="b42dc01b-3bad-4d3c-991a-41d5cb2909a4">
  <data key="d3">Assigning rights under the policy inherently reduces control over them, particularly because such rights are subject to prior claims by irrevocable beneficiaries, who take precedence regardless of assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="771de587-5b8c-4772-ae4a-1e306c16617f">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 indicates that an assignment could fully block the use of certain rights. This builds upon fact sentence 1’s notion of limitation, showing how restrictions escalate from partial to total exclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558">
  <data key="d3">Assignment limitations reduce specific rights, but the policy owner generally retains full control over contractual rights as long as the insured is alive and no external restrictions apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="775ca55f-580f-4b78-8f96-9fb875dfd32a">
  <data key="d3">Assignment can restrict specific rights under the policy, but the policy owner maintains full control over contractual rights unless those rights have been specifically curtailed through an assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="74da563a-668e-4838-9c04-3edc34513cfb">
  <data key="d3">Assignment may restrict some policyholder rights, though such restrictions are secondary to those explicitly created by irrevocable beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="311330de-41eb-43d2-9f52-1faca7a7786e">
  <data key="d3">Assignment by the policy owner limits certain rights under the policy, consistent with the broader rule that assigned rights are subordinated. This reflects how exercising the right to assign impacts other entitlements.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">Assignment limits specific rights under the policy, yet the Policy Owner’s actions remain legally binding on all involved parties regardless of such limitations.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">Assignment of rights imposes limitations that ensure the Policy Owner’s actions remain within defined boundaries set by the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c00b8cbc-6567-4b8d-bdc3-c86e1beaf121" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has rights restricted by</data>
</edge>
<edge source="445f6c95-4517-4f15-9020-f4457db7175d" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has rights restricted by</data>
</edge>
<edge source="90fddad5-0535-412a-b5a1-b6befa8ca9a1" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">restricts</data>
</edge>
<edge source="651ecfc2-a112-4999-a600-534939fdee87" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">rights subject to assignment limitation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a2d2fa0d-4808-4e7b-a748-3b1fa11caa62" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">assignment limits rights</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="263ac02c-ab9c-4e95-a98a-67bdda9c3594">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="e968570e-c18f-49c7-9bcc-93d13ae17877">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">organization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="15fa017b-ee8c-460b-98d6-3c9eaf24a413">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">person</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="859cd67a-7574-4e82-a42f-d66b9bb2226c">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="47e7a1dc-25d0-4ea7-a2ad-742d794bf497">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="4251a026-1a47-4cab-8d9f-089e3d4148d2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="2a4049e2-fd24-46a8-a492-487c32465130">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="90b1e1b1-3898-4440-bf93-a768daa6084b">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="5234ec43-d789-45f0-b159-c8ca4abc9aa8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="e66c1d29-1937-451c-bfd0-57d777de7ff8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="c210d212-8be1-4a07-8113-5910af1aadd5">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="d50481f4-fd6e-4b61-9fcd-2f387102d5da">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted authority enables them to initiate assignments, such as through written notice, consistent with company requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="4a4ca44e-1767-405f-8f6b-09fab8417798">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted rights allow them to initiate assignments, making the act of assignment logically consistent with their retained powers.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="68b1219a-81cc-436d-b9fa-18329365fedb">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unimpeded authority over contract rights aligns with the principle that such powers are exercised independently of third-party claims, including invalid assignments.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="6e440086-23d0-4b7f-adcc-b2cb7b037991">
  <data key="d3">The claim that the policy owner can exercise all rights without consent underscores their autonomy, which indirectly supports why the company would not assume responsibility for how those rights are transferred via assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="771de587-5b8c-4772-ae4a-1e306c16617f">
  <data key="d3">Even though the policy owner enjoys unrestricted rights while the insured is alive, those rights can be limited if an assignment occurs, particularly when it involves subordination or notification requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="7b4a5d81-6d8d-43cc-94ef-d8cd7aa0e8a8">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted right to exercise all contractual powers during the insured’s life implies that assignments only affect limited aspects of those rights, not total control.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="775ca55f-580f-4b78-8f96-9fb875dfd32a">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds complete control over the contract while the insured is alive, but this authority is subject to exceptions introduced by assignments. Thus, the initial freedom is contextually bounded by specific legal arrangements.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="74da563a-668e-4838-9c04-3edc34513cfb">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds complete control over the contract while the insured is alive, but this authority is subject to limitations imposed by an irrevocable beneficiary designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="23213712-f92d-4cba-b4d4-2b1015682944">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds complete authority over the policy while the insured is alive, enabling them to modify key provisions like the beneficiary designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="311330de-41eb-43d2-9f52-1faca7a7786e">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted authority over the policy while the insured is alive enables them to assign it, making assignment a permissible action within their existing rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="f16e49b5-127a-4da9-9b3d-98d87f3e061a">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted right to manage the policy while the insured is alive enables them to select optional benefit forms, reflecting the breadth of their authority.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to exercise all contractual rights includes accessing policy information while the insured is alive.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted rights during the insured’s life enable them to act decisively, and such actions legally bind all parties with an interest in the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="d01b45ac-0eb6-487a-be72-95174a8cf9aa">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner holds comprehensive rights over the policy while the insured is alive, but these rights are constrained by existing legal requirements that govern their actions.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinated to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds extensive rights while the insured is alive, but these rights are constrained by the overarching terms of the policy, ensuring compliance with its conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="daede05c-af65-4efd-8af7-defc13a4b417">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner has full rights during the insured's life, enabling them to request changes like altering the payment mode, subject to insurer approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="e92e0ea5-c65d-41a2-8ffb-fb2ed9910e6d">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds complete authority over the contract while the insured is alive, but this right depends on fulfilling financial obligations like timely premium payments to maintain the policy’s validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds complete authority over the policy while the insured is alive, enabling them to maintain coverage by making timely payments even within the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="a20ed2b4-2a6b-44d6-aa80-4f3de6e88160">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted authority while the insured is alive sets the stage for how benefits are managed after death, particularly when payment obligations remain unresolved during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holds exclusive rights during the insured's life, but failing to pay premiums within the grace period causes the policy to lapse, resulting in loss of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional consequence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="15fa017b-ee8c-460b-98d6-3c9eaf24a413" target="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">exercises contractual rights</data>
</edge>
