  <data key="d3">Even though the policy owner has the right to request information about the policy while the insured is living, that right may be limited by prior assignments that subordinate certain entitlements.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558">
  <data key="d3">Requesting policy information is one of the many rights available to the policy owner when the insured is living.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="775ca55f-580f-4b78-8f96-9fb875dfd32a">
  <data key="d3">The ability to request policy information while the insured is living reflects the unrestrictive nature of the Policy Owner’s rights, consistent with the absence of assignments limiting such actions.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="74da563a-668e-4838-9c04-3edc34513cfb">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s unrestricted rights under the contract include requesting policy information, ensuring transparency and control over the policy during the insured’s lifetime.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="23213712-f92d-4cba-b4d4-2b1015682944">
  <data key="d3">Requesting policy information enables the Policy Owner to make informed decisions regarding beneficiary changes, ensuring accurate updates based on current policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="f16e49b5-127a-4da9-9b3d-98d87f3e061a">
  <data key="d3">Access to policy information supports informed decision-making about optional benefits, enabling the Policy Owner to make educated choices regarding benefit options.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="d01b45ac-0eb6-487a-be72-95174a8cf9aa">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner's ability to access policy information is limited by legal requirements, ensuring that such requests comply with applicable regulations.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s ability to access policy information is conditional upon complying with the policy’s governing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinated to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">The ability of the Policy Owner to obtain policy information provides foundational context necessary for making informed, legally binding decisions regarding the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="04c48339-a09a-4dea-809f-8cf26cbb5dd7" target="daede05c-af65-4efd-8af7-defc13a4b417">
  <data key="d3">The ability to obtain policy information enables the owner to understand terms before requesting changes to payment modes. This foundational knowledge supports informed requests for modifications like changing how premiums are paid.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
