<edge source="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e" target="d01b45ac-0eb6-487a-be72-95174a8cf9aa">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 specifies that the Policy Owner’s conduct is bound by the policy’s own terms, forming a core condition. Fact sentence 1 extends this by requiring adherence to broader applicable laws, ensuring alignment beyond just contractual obligations.</data>
  <data key="d4">bound by</data>
