  <data key="d3">The policy owner cannot claim participation in company surpluses because the policy explicitly states it is nonparticipating, aligning with contractual limitations on owner actions.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e" target="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s actions are bound by the overall terms of the contract, one of which is that the policy is nonparticipating, meaning no dividend entitlements exist regardless of ownership decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
