  <data key="d3">The restriction on future dividends stems from the policy’s nonparticipating status, which is part of the governing terms under which the Policy Owner operates.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
