  <data key="d3">The policy’s restriction on sharing in company earnings aligns with the broader principle that the Policy Owner’s authority is limited by contractual terms, ensuring compliance with the nonparticipating status.</data>
  <data key="d4">consistent with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e" target="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s authority is limited by the policy’s nonparticipating nature, which explicitly prohibits any dividend payouts. Therefore, the lack of current dividends stems directly from the contractual framework governing the Owner’s actions.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
