  <data key="d3">The policy’s requirement that owners act according to its terms includes compliance with premium deadlines. Failure to pay within the grace period triggers automatic lapse, reflecting how ownership responsibilities are bound by specific conditions outlined in the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinates to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
