  <data key="d3">The fact that the policy is nonparticipating is part of the contractual framework governing how the Policy Owner may act, limiting potential expectations about financial returns from the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">constrains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95" target="675e6ad8-541e-4de3-8117-4f94ae24cfec">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the policy is nonparticipating, which means it does not share in company surplus. Fact sentence 2 explicitly confirms this by stating the policy shall not share in any surplus.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95" target="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the policy is nonparticipating, which means it does not share in company earnings. Fact sentence 2 explicitly confirms this by stating the policy shall not share in any earnings of the Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95" target="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402">
  <data key="d3">The policy's nonparticipating status means it does not distribute dividends. Therefore, no dividends are payable to the policy owner at present.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95" target="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's nonparticipating status means it does not generate dividends. Therefore, no dividends are payable to the policy owner in the future.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95" target="be7f41e9-f83b-4532-b16a-6d60d99dd86a">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy is nonparticipating, its premiums are fixed according to the insurer’s original underwriting assumptions and pricing criteria established at issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
