<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">The absence of profit-sharing reflects a structural limitation within the policy, consistent with the requirement that the Policy Owner act only within defined boundaries set forth in the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95">
  <data key="d3">The statement that the policy shall not share in any earnings of the Company clarifies what is meant by the policy being nonparticipating, reinforcing the same concept from a different phrasing.</data>
  <data key="d4">restates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="675e6ad8-541e-4de3-8117-4f94ae24cfec">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 asserts the policy doesn't share in company earnings, which inherently covers the exclusion of surplus mentioned in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">encompasses</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402">
  <data key="d3">The statement that the policy does not participate in company earnings explains why no dividends are currently payable to the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e">
  <data key="d3">The statement that the policy does not share in company earnings logically supports the conclusion that no future dividends will be payable to the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">implies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b" target="be7f41e9-f83b-4532-b16a-6d60d99dd86a">
  <data key="d3">The policy's nonparticipation in company earnings justifies the use of fixed pricing standards at issue when setting premiums, ensuring financial predictability without reliance on future profits.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
