</edge>
<edge source="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy does not participate in surplus distributions, it naturally follows that no dividends can be paid—even if the Policy Owner takes action—because such outcomes are precluded by the policy’s fundamental design.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402" target="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95">
  <data key="d3">Because no dividends are payable to the policy owner, this reflects the policy’s nonparticipating nature, where participants do not share in company profits.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402" target="675e6ad8-541e-4de3-8117-4f94ae24cfec">
  <data key="d3">Since no dividends are payable to the policy owner, this reflects the underlying characteristic that the policy does not participate in any surplus distribution by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402" target="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy is nonparticipating and does not share in company earnings, it logically follows that no dividends are payable to the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402" target="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes the current absence of dividend payments, which logically extends into the future as stated in fact sentence 2, maintaining consistency with the policy’s nonparticipating nature.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends to future</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
