<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="74da563a-668e-4838-9c04-3edc34513cfb">
  <data key="d3">The absence of dividend payments reflects the policy’s nonparticipating status, reinforcing that the policy owner does not receive financial returns, even though their contractual rights remain intact barring specific designations like irrevocable beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual supports</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy does not participate in surplus earnings, the absence of dividends is consistent with the limitations imposed on the Policy Owner’s rights as defined in the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="222e3616-509e-41e7-8e0a-8df9ddd50f95">
  <data key="d3">Because no dividends are payable to the policy owner, the policy must be classified as nonparticipating, reflecting its lack of profit-sharing features.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="675e6ad8-541e-4de3-8117-4f94ae24cfec">
  <data key="d3">Since no dividends are payable to the policyowner, it confirms the policy’s nonparticipating nature, aligning with its lack of entitlement to company surplus.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="497f8eb6-dc59-49fd-b3a0-653bed16b13b">
  <data key="d3">Since no dividends are payable to the policy owner, it confirms the policy’s nonparticipating nature, aligning with its exclusion from sharing in company earnings.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1a6344cf-ea03-47a1-be12-6fbc60df405e" target="1368ebec-9201-44b1-a9ef-90b544575402">
  <data key="d3">The future absence of dividends described in fact sentence 2 builds upon the current reality established in fact sentence 1, reinforcing the permanent exclusion of dividends under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">based on current state</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
