</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="2940b504-0b37-4a43-8502-2feaeb5668ba">
  <data key="d3">Premium rates are determined by the underwriting class, which considers age among other factors. Thus, being outside the insurable age range could trigger a reclassification affecting both rate setting and potential reduction in death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">drives</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="be7f41e9-f83b-4532-b16a-6d60d99dd86a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that premiums depend on the insured's underwriting class, which is part of the larger framework described in fact_sentence_2—the company’s overall pricing standards at issue. Thus, underwriting class contributes to those standard calculations.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="e92e0ea5-c65d-41a2-8ffb-fb2ed9910e6d">
  <data key="d3">The underwriting class affects the premium rate, determining how much must be paid. This amount must be paid in advance by the specified due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="a20ed2b4-2a6b-44d6-aa80-4f3de6e88160">
  <data key="d3">The underwriting class determines the base premium rate, which influences whether a premium remains unpaid during the grace period. This unpaid balance directly affects the final death benefit calculation when the insured passes away.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains how premium costs are determined by the insured's underwriting classification. This information sets the baseline amount owed, which may influence whether the insured can meet the payment deadline during the 31-day grace period described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount, set by the insured's underwriting class, determines the financial obligation whose timely payment prevents policy lapse during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="890170f0-132b-4d31-af4e-ad3c5eaabe01" target="5182202e-021d-43a3-9210-05e10387d554">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has underwriting class</data>
</edge>
