</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">Properly executing premium payments via an authorized agent with a receipt supports the enforceability of the Policy Owner’s decisions, reinforcing their binding effect on all involved parties.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="d01b45ac-0eb6-487a-be72-95174a8cf9aa">
  <data key="d3">Paying premiums via an authorized agent with proper receipt issuance ensures adherence to legal obligations imposed on the policy owner’s conduct, reinforcing lawful behavior required by regulation.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">Policy Owner actions, such as paying premiums, must comply with formal procedures outlined in the contract, ensuring adherence to established terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">subordinated to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="e92e0ea5-c65d-41a2-8ffb-fb2ed9910e6d">
  <data key="d3">The need to obtain an official receipt, as stated in fact_sentence_2, reinforces compliance with the timing obligation outlined in fact_sentence_1, ensuring proof of timely payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="d935b2c7-ac58-442f-bdca-43a72846d5c9">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 outlines a secondary method of premium payment via an authorized agent who issues a receipt, reinforcing the validity of such transactions even when they deviate from direct payment to the administrative office described in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">complementary to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Payment must be made to an authorized agent with receipt issuance, but a 31-day grace period permits late payment without termination, ensuring continuity despite timing delays.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d3">Payment to an authorized agent secures documented proof of premium submission, enabling the policyholder to remain covered under the grace period provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">Payment of premiums via an authorized agent ensures proper recordkeeping, but if not made before the grace period ends, it triggers automatic policy lapse effective from the original due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="a20ed2b4-2a6b-44d6-aa80-4f3de6e88160">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums on time triggers consequences during the grace period, such as deductions from the death benefit when the insured passes away before payment is made.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums via an authorized agent may result in the policy lapsing, leading to termination of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="beb154c0-38f0-479b-a7fb-0161a5525768" target="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">receives payment via authorized agent</data>
</edge>
