  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="db503b49-a6e9-46e4-9367-8f9f8bc2c764">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="82533a78-8039-4976-ab30-4fbb2ece6dcb">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="36398b76-bafc-4e2a-91ba-1f606912b3b6">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="c973474c-d230-409f-ad33-e1a682af9558">
  <data key="d3">As long as the policy remains in effect during the grace period, the policy owner continues to retain full rights to act on behalf of the policy without needing third-party approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="775ca55f-580f-4b78-8f96-9fb875dfd32a">
  <data key="d3">The policy remaining in force during the grace period relies on the policy owner retaining unimpeded access to their contractual rights, such as making timely payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="48170372-67f9-431b-afea-2352f772cc6e">
  <data key="d3">The policy remaining in force during the grace period depends on the Policy Owner taking timely action, such as paying premiums, reinforcing the binding nature of their decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="988c3be0-9555-43fe-a0e7-92bfd1b7079e">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of policy validity during the grace period is consistent with the requirement that all Policy Owner actions adhere to established policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="e92e0ea5-c65d-41a2-8ffb-fb2ed9910e6d">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows for delayed premium payments without immediate loss of coverage, contingent upon paying within the specified window.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="d935b2c7-ac58-442f-bdca-43a72846d5c9">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows time for premium payment at the administrative office without immediate loss of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="fc861170-d441-42f0-9df2-68e6af8ebe13">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period allows time for premium payment without immediate lapse, making adherence to the payment method specified by the insurer essential.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy stays in force during the grace period, it ensures uninterrupted protection even when a premium is paid late. This continuity relies directly on the presence of the 31-day grace window.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="a20ed2b4-2a6b-44d6-aa80-4f3de6e88160">
  <data key="d3">The policy's validity during the grace period ensures ongoing protection, which enables the application of specific payout rules if the insured dies within that window.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">The policy remains active during the grace period, but failure to make payment by its end triggers automatic termination effective from the original due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional consequence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">The policy stays effective during the grace period, preventing immediate lapse. Coverage ultimately ceases once the grace period expires without payment, resulting in policy lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="9a6577b2-6763-4f14-9b38-f89dde765452">
  <data key="d3">A 31-day grace period means the policyholder has additional time to pay premiums without losing coverage, supporting continuous protection under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="6c933248-145a-4629-9244-b471149ae619">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage despite late payments, but if the premium isn't settled by its end, the policy terminates effective from the original due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="dc295506-9994-4bc6-8410-24347075b1d6">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage despite late payments, but if premiums remain unpaid beyond this window, the policy lapses and coverage terminates permanently unless reinstated.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage, preventing policy lapse and thus maintaining eligibility for benefits, which would otherwise be denied upon lapse per the second statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures coverage continues until renewal, preventing immediate lapse; this allows time for reinstatement later if needed, making it a precursor to the reinstatement clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="f132426a-4a89-442f-804e-9685b2a8370a">
  <data key="d3">The grace period allows ongoing coverage even after missed payments, but if it expires, reinstatement becomes necessary, requiring repayment of overdue premiums with interest as stipulated.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="e7c4ba5d-2f8a-4bd9-8e77-4018f8285f7a">
  <data key="d3">The grace period allows continued coverage post-premium default, preventing automatic lapse; however, if unpaid beyond this window, reinstatement becomes necessary and hinges on submitting acceptable evidence of insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage until renewal is missed, leading to potential lapse; reinstatement after such lapse requires a written request, making it dependent on post-lapse action.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="3c433250-298a-4a66-9011-6ba31393c55a">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage despite late payments, creating the possibility for future reinstatement without interruption. This condition enables the policyholder to restore coverage under the terms described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">The grace period allows continued coverage despite late payments, enabling future reinstatement, which triggers a new contestability period under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables reinstatement</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves active policy status, preventing a lapse; therefore, claims during this time remain covered, aligning with the condition that liability only ceases after actual lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing policy coverage, enabling the policyowner to maintain eligibility for conversion to permanent insurance before the expiry date.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves active coverage temporarily after missed premiums, while the absence of automatic renewal means the policy terminates at end-of-term unless action is taken—these features together define the boundaries of ongoing protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves active coverage until renewal, enabling potential reinstatement later, which triggers renewed suicide exclusions. Without the grace period's continuity, reinstatement would not be possible, making it foundational to subsequent terms like the resumption of suicide exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="82a10084-3f57-48dc-9e6f-f24c360934c3">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage even if premiums are delayed, providing time before lapsing, which may allow sufficient window to exercise conversion rights to permanent insurance without needing evidence of insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables conversion</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves active coverage temporarily, enabling the policyholder to maintain benefits until premiums are paid, which may allow sufficient time to meet the deadline for converting the policy during its designated conversion period.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensuring continuous coverage depends on timely premium payment per the product's terms, making the second fact essential for maintaining the condition stated in the first.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d3">The grace period preserves coverage temporarily, enabling the insured to maintain eligibility for conversion into permanent life insurance, provided they meet age limitations before the end of the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.78</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e" target="effe3ea6-daae-4c03-b44b-e751e10ea2f2">
  <data key="d3">The grace period ensures ongoing coverage until premiums are paid, but its validity and implementation depend on compliance with New York state law, which governs the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8c6da4aa-5314-4dde-8b2f-99031e5f712f" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is protected by</data>
</edge>
