  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390" target="6c0901ed-f52a-4ce9-9d52-9547016ca265">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 explains the consequence of failing to pay premiums within the grace period, which could cause the end of the coverage period described in fact_sentence_1 before its scheduled conclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
