  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that no benefits are payable during a lapse (except through reinstatement) connects logically to the resumption of the suicide exclusion at reinstatement, ensuring that newly reactivated policies remain subject to initial risk assessment terms.</data>
