</edge>
<edge source="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that no benefits are payable upon lapse (fact_sentence_1) is qualified by the possibility of reinstatement, which activates a new contestability period (fact_sentence_2). This creates a conditional pathway for benefit eligibility post-lapse.</data>
