  <data key="d3">The possibility of reinstating a lapsed policy within five years depends directly on its prior lapse caused by failure to pay premiums within the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy within five years restores the right to benefits, thereby enabling exceptions to the general rule that no benefits are payable post-lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
