  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years depends on submitting a formal written request, making this step critical to exercising the reinstatement option.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="3c433250-298a-4a66-9011-6ba31393c55a">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years enables the restoration of continuous coverage, ensuring the policy functions as if it never terminated.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="f132426a-4a89-442f-804e-9685b2a8370a">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years depends on fulfilling specific requirements, including paying overdue premiums along with applicable interest as mandated by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy after its expiration restarts the incontestability clock, ensuring the insurer cannot later challenge the validity of the policy based on misrepresentations made at the time of reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="8453f6b0-fb6e-4aa6-ab20-20d1e0198fd4">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy within five years ensures continued validity, allowing the death benefit to be payable under the policy’s full terms, including any requirements tied to reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy after its expiration resets key contractual terms, including the suicide exclusion period, ensuring that newly revived policies undergo updated risk evaluation based on current circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
