  <data key="d3">Reinstatement eligibility after a lapse depends on the initial cause—the failure to pay a premium before the grace period ends—which directly links back to the original obligation described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables recovery</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
