  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years offers a pathway to avoid losing death benefit eligibility, thereby preventing situations where unpaid premiums would otherwise reduce payouts upon death during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
