  <data key="d3">A lapsed policy resulting from missing the grace period can be revived within five years, making the existence of the grace period crucial to maintaining reinstatement eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e" target="9aff7508-84dd-468d-83c6-658c086cf16c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 extends the implications of the lapse defined in fact_sentence_1 by specifying a window during which the terminated policy can be revived, reinforcing the significance of timely action post-lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables recovery</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
