  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5" target="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390">
  <data key="d3">A written request for reinstatement is essential to enable benefits after lapse, directly fulfilling the precondition stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
