  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy depends on meeting conditions including submitting evidence of insurability, ensuring that the originally designated beneficiary (Taylor Ellis) remains eligible to receive proceeds upon successful reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
