  <data key="d3">While the policy covers until July 31, 2045, it can lapse if premiums aren't paid within the 31-day grace period, triggering the requirement to submit evidence of insurability for reinstatement under specified conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
