<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="6c933248-145a-4629-9244-b471149ae619">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy triggers a new incontestability period, but only after the conditions like overdue premium repayment have been met, as outlined when a policy lapses due to non-payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on lapse</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="dc295506-9994-4bc6-8410-24347075b1d6">
  <data key="d3">The resetting of the incontestability provision after reinstatement depends on the prior occurrence of a policy lapse caused by nonpayment.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy reactivates its terms, including eligibility for benefit payments—otherwise prohibited during lapse—and triggers the start of a fresh incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers renewal of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e">
  <data key="d3">The start of a fresh incontestability period depends directly on the successful reinstatement of a lapsed policy, making reinstitution a prerequisite for resetting legal safeguards.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5">
  <data key="d3">The beginning of a new incontestability period after reinstatement presupposes that a formal request has been submitted and accepted, making it dependent on the reinstatement procedure initiated by the request.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="e7c4ba5d-2f8a-4bd9-8e77-4018f8285f7a">
  <data key="d3">The start of a fresh incontestability period after reinstatement depends on completing prerequisites like submitting proof of insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="f132426a-4a89-442f-804e-9685b2a8370a">
  <data key="d3">A renewed incontestability period commences upon reinstatement, which itself requires full payment of overdue premiums including interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="3c433250-298a-4a66-9011-6ba31393c55a">
  <data key="d3">Because coverage resumes as if uninterrupted after reinstatement, the incontestability period begins afresh from that point, aligning with the restored status of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">preceded by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states that the Incontestability clause resets at reinstatement. This directly supports Fact sentence 2 by establishing that new eligibility windows start afresh after reinstatement, making the Suicide Exclusion also applicable under updated conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability clause restarting at reinstatement implies a new two-year window where the insurer cannot dispute the policy's validity due to misrepresentation, which is exactly what fact_sentence_2 specifies.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability provision restarting upon reinstatement aligns with the resumption of the suicide exclusion, both establishing new risk evaluation windows post-reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">The renewal of the incontestability clause post-reinstatement implies that future challenges to the policy's validity are barred, but it does not affect claims from before reinstatement. Thus, the insurer remains exempt from liabilities incurred during the lapse, even though coverage resumes afterward under new terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains that the incontestability clause resets upon reinstatement, which directly supports the timing described in fact_sentence_2 about the start of a new contestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains that the incontestability clause resets upon reinstatement, which directly supports fact_sentence_2’s claim about initiating a fresh two-year contestability window from the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability clause restarting after reinstatement sets the foundation for when the suicide exclusion becomes effective, ensuring consistency in policy renewal terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability provision restarting at reinstatement enables the full death benefit eligibility outlined in fact_sentence_2 after two years, ensuring long-term protection once the policy is revived.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
