<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="dc295506-9994-4bc6-8410-24347075b1d6">
  <data key="d3">The restart of the Suicide Exclusion provision depends on the policy being reinstated after lapsing due to nonpayment, meaning its activation hinges on prior termination caused by missed premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="38763c7f-abef-4ce9-83af-a9a6ee8c0390">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy triggers the reset of the suicide exclusion, meaning its terms apply afresh based on the reinstatement date rather than the original issue date.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers reset</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="e97bc08e-664f-4d67-a896-a8654db9c55e">
  <data key="d3">The initiation of a new suicide exclusion period relies directly on the act of reinstating a previously lapsed policy, making the timing of reinstatement critical for determining eligibility under this clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">preceded by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5">
  <data key="d3">The start of the Suicide Exclusion provision anew relies on the prior submission of a written reinstatement request, making it dependent on the initiation of the reinstatement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="e7c4ba5d-2f8a-4bd9-8e77-4018f8285f7a">
  <data key="d3">The start of the Suicide Exclusion provision at reinstatement relies on the successful submission and acceptance of evidence of insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="3c433250-298a-4a66-9011-6ba31393c55a">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion resets at reinstatement, reflecting a new start under the policy’s rules. As a result, coverage effectively resumes without prior limitations, maintaining continuity except for time-sensitive clauses.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 notes the Suicide Exclusion begins anew post-reinstatement. This reinforces Fact sentence 1 because if exclusions reset, so too does the window during which the insurer cannot contest the claim—both depend on the same triggering event: reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="8453f6b0-fb6e-4aa6-ab20-20d1e0198fd4">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion restarts after reinstatement, meaning its rules apply again based on new effective dates tied to revival. This rule falls under the general principle that death benefits are subject to all policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="2a08c0b6-2e7e-4895-939b-cc9797b12f18">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion restarting at reinstatement may limit the payment of the death benefit even if the policy was active when the insured died, thereby affecting whether the conditions in fact_sentence_2 are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion restarting at reinstatement coincides with the beginning of a new contestability period, ensuring the insurer can investigate deaths due to suicide only after the full two-year term has passed post-reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that the suicide exclusion resets upon reinstatement, which is confirmed and elaborated by fact_sentence_2 stating the exclusion resumes from that point. Together, they clarify continuity of risk assessment policies after revival.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion restarting at reinstatement complements the clause stating the company isn't liable for claims during the lapse period, ensuring that deaths due to suicide before reinstatement fall outside coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that the suicide exclusion renews at reinstatement, which supports and contextualizes fact_sentence_2's claim about the resumption of the contestability period under similar conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 states the suicide exclusion begins again after reinstatement, which is confirmed and elaborated upon in fact sentence 2, showing alignment in timing and conditionality.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion renews upon reinstatement, directly supporting the idea that the contestability period—including its associated suicide limitations—also restarts from the same effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">The suicide exclusion renews at reinstatement, but after two years from that date, the restriction ends, enabling full death benefit eligibility irrespective of cause.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
