  <data key="d3">Outstanding debts, such as unpaid premiums beyond the grace period, can diminish the death benefit, making the initial premium amount relevant to determining net payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">impacted by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
