  <data key="d3">Requiring additional documentation based on reasonableness supports the administrative conditions under which a lapsed policy can be reinstated within five years.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="7f26a565-4af4-450c-9a70-1dd435ed96e5">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises during the reinstatement process, potentially prompted by the submission of a written request, but only if justified under reasonable standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="e7c4ba5d-2f8a-4bd9-8e77-4018f8285f7a">
  <data key="d3">Insurers have discretion to demand extra documentation when reinstating a lapsed policy, even after the basic requirement of proving insurability has been met.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="3c433250-298a-4a66-9011-6ba31393c55a">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of needing further documentation arises during reinstatement, which ensures continuity of coverage as if it never lapsed.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="8453f6b0-fb6e-4aa6-ab20-20d1e0198fd4">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of requiring extra documents stems directly from the policy’s stipulations about how benefits are distributed upon death, reinforcing adherence to contractual obligations.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="b8c541a1-08d6-4493-9d12-7e4b17736e50">
  <data key="d3">Additional documentation may be requested to verify details like outstanding debts, ensuring accuracy when calculating the net death benefit, including deductions for liabilities.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="1ad14f44-4ab9-4865-bd44-65dbcba3e242">
  <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_2 allows for extra documentation requests, it operates within the framework established by fact_sentence_1, which sets the foundational need for proof of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends</data>
