  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 indicates that extra documents might be needed due to reasonable judgment, possibly related to claim verification. Fact_sentence_2 states the company has authority to probe the details surrounding the insured’s death, which could involve requesting such documentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="81fd1296-c3bf-4581-b20f-126e5d595425">
  <data key="d3">The need for extra documentation due to reasonableness concerns can impact the timeline for finalizing claim approvals, thereby affecting promptness of death benefit payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614" target="a49cafd1-8d48-414f-8488-d5ff6730e3d9">
  <data key="d3">While the grace period maintains policy validity temporarily, any need for extra documentation from the insurer might affect whether timely action occurs to preserve coverage beyond the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
