<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="2a08c0b6-2e7e-4895-939b-cc9797b12f18">
  <data key="d3">Before paying the death benefit upon the insured’s death, the company exercises its right to investigate the cause and circumstances of death, ensuring validity of the claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="8453f6b0-fb6e-4aa6-ab20-20d1e0198fd4">
  <data key="d3">The company's right to investigate the cause and circumstances of death supports its ability to enforce the terms and conditions governing the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="2474d284-5bd2-401c-91b1-36a9a5e512cb">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to investigate the cause of death ensures adherence to policy terms, including verifying eligibility for the full face amount specified in the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="1ad14f44-4ab9-4865-bd44-65dbcba3e242">
  <data key="d3">The company’s ability to investigate the cause and circumstances of death ensures it can properly assess whether sufficient proof of death has been submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">justifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="0eab6e49-c223-4495-87bb-58f1202750b4">
  <data key="d3">The company's right to investigate the cause and circumstances of death necessitates reliable proof like a certified death certificate to validate the claim and ensure legitimacy.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="7b26fed4-7c69-4d32-aa07-45ab4d3be614">
  <data key="d3">The company’s ability to investigate the cause and circumstances of death implies it may require further evidence, including supplementary documentation, to support its inquiry into the legitimacy of the claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470">
  <data key="d3">The company’s right to investigate the cause of death provides the basis for determining whether a claim should be contested under the contestability clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="81fd1296-c3bf-4581-b20f-126e5d595425">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to investigate the cause of death ensures accuracy before processing claims. This step directly enables timely payment once approved documentation confirms eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="a49cafd1-8d48-414f-8488-d5ff6730e3d9">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s authority to investigate the cause of death depends on the policy being active, which is preserved by the grace period following missed premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on grace period</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="9aff7508-84dd-468d-83c6-658c086cf16c">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to investigate death depends on the policy being active at time of death; if the policy has lapsed, this right does not apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a policy depends on future claim validity, where the insurer may investigate the cause of death—even if the policy was restored—to verify entitlement to benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="c9a8b525-e466-428a-9f1b-a7e27067ae66">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s ability to verify the cause of death supports accurate determination of the payable amount outlined in the policy specifications.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="ae130c33-876d-4d39-9ee6-6b6250047099">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to investigate death causes supports accurate assessment of whether the death benefit should be adjusted due to prior misrepresentation, linking post-death scrutiny to pre-existing factual errors.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595" target="c7c925cb-8c15-4c3e-98c7-37dd24303a91">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s ability to investigate death details supports enforcement of terms like those in fact_sentence_1, where misstatements affect payouts, helping verify whether inaccuracies influenced the original underwriting decision.</data>
  <data key="d4">informs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
