  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">payment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="c5ce6485-876c-4ee0-8405-fc0a717b28f8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">rate</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="2a08c0b6-2e7e-4895-939b-cc9797b12f18">
  <data key="d3">The insurer has the right to contest a death claim during the contestability period, even if the insured died while the policy was in force and eligible for benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="8453f6b0-fb6e-4aa6-ab20-20d1e0198fd4">
  <data key="d3">The ability of the company to contest a claim during the contestability period is a key provision that defines part of the broader set of terms governing the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">example of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="2474d284-5bd2-401c-91b1-36a9a5e512cb">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of contesting the claim during the contestability period means the guaranteed death benefit might not be paid if fraud or misrepresentation is found.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="0eab6e49-c223-4495-87bb-58f1202750b4">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of claim contestation during the contestability period necessitates strong supporting documents, including a certified death certificate, to validate the legitimacy of the claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="9a3ebe6d-6903-418b-acd4-b78709d3f595">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of claiming contestation during the contestability period justifies the need for the company to investigate the cause and circumstances of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">justified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="81fd1296-c3bf-4581-b20f-126e5d595425">
  <data key="d3">If a claim arises during the contestability period, it may be challenged by the insurer before any payment is issued. However, once all necessary documents are submitted and verified, the death benefit is disbursed without delay.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="9aff7508-84dd-468d-83c6-658c086cf16c">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a contestability period depends on the policy being active at time of death; thus, a lapse invalidates coverage and generally removes the possibility of future contestation related to pre-lapse misrepresentations.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of claiming contestation depends on whether the policy has been successfully reinstated after lapse, making reinstatement a prerequisite for ongoing claim scrutiny rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="c9a8b525-e466-428a-9f1b-a7e27067ae66">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a clearly defined death benefit depends on the absence of contested claims, particularly those arising from inaccuracies disclosed during the application process.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b2f5e21-9f40-4e43-859c-578858c6f470" target="ae130c33-876d-4d39-9ee6-6b6250047099">
  <data key="d3">The ability to contest claims during the contestability period enables the insurer to adjust or deny the death benefit based on prior misstatements, including inaccurate age reporting.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
