  <data key="d3">Chunk 1 provides foundational context on claim settlement and beneficiary payouts, which chunk 2 extends by detailing specific scenarios like simultaneous deaths and revocable vs. irrevocable beneficiary status that affect how those settlements unfold.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends context</data>
