<edge source="a1058e7f-8f18-49f2-bc24-6b94e7ac24c5" target="d680623c-b8e6-4216-87fc-f28fbd801474">
  <data key="d3">When uncertainty arises over who died first, the legal presumption that the beneficiary predeceased the insured depends on the prior understanding that beneficiaries are those designated to receive benefits.</data>
