  <data key="d3">When the order of death is uncertain, the law presumes the beneficiary predeceased the insured, but this rule assumes a validly designated beneficiary was previously established through formal filing.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
