  <data key="d3">The legal presumption that the beneficiary predeceased the insured ensures clarity in determining eligibility for the contingent beneficiary, thereby enabling the process described in fact_sentence_1 to proceed correctly.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
