</edge>
<edge source="a1058e7f-8f18-49f2-bc24-6b94e7ac24c5" target="38974002-cdef-417b-abe4-05fe910d1ed4">
  <data key="d3">The legal presumption that a beneficiary predeceased the insured in case of simultaneous deaths ensures that the estate becomes the recipient of proceeds when no viable beneficiary remains.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
