  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 provides essential context about premium obligations and ownership rights, which are prerequisites for reinstatement and determine whether claims may proceed even when subject to exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">provides context for restrictions</data>
