  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 extends its discussion by confirming that reinstatement triggers a fresh contestability period and reactivates suicide exclusions, while also introducing additional procedural and legal safeguards.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
