<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="2ccc2a1b-cdc3-45ef-9eca-fa939da40950">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 introduces a key exception to the incontestability rule described in fact_sentence_1, specifying that nonpayment of premiums negates the protection granted after two years.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
