<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="4ba5aa3e-d14a-4e24-9784-1bfc938f9518">
  <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period begins at issuance but excludes cases involving material misrepresentation, allowing insurers to reject claims based on false statements made during application.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="3f3c482f-63c7-4446-b46e-136dbb82436d">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability provision applies after two years unless there was a material misrepresentation in the application, meaning such misrepresentations remain grounds for policy rescission even beyond the two-year mark.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="20a49319-596a-4eb4-9cf6-c48e01ba5bb2">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of the two-year contestability period, as stated in fact_sentence_1, leads directly to the insurer losing the right to dispute the policy's validity, regardless of prior misrepresentations, as described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">The initial two-year contestability period applies from the issue date unless terminated early by nonpayment. Reinstatement restarts this period, meaning the exclusivity condition reactivates from the new effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="b418554b-6c94-4f40-8a92-5c7ae9e4a969">
  <data key="d3">The initial contestability clause sets a baseline timeframe for challenges, but the second sentence adds nuance by allowing continued contestation only if fraud is proven, thereby limiting the scope of future disputes despite expiration of the primary window.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">The original two-year contestability period ends after two years unless triggered again by reinstatement. Upon reinstatement, a fresh contestability window starts based exclusively on the reinstatement application’s content.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
