  <data key="d3">The insurer’s inability to contest the policy after two years, described in fact_sentence_2, results from the expiration of the initial two-year contestability window established in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd">
  <data key="d3">The inability of the insurer to contest the policy’s validity, stated in fact_sentence_2, results from the expiration of the two-year contestability window defined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="3f3c482f-63c7-4446-b46e-136dbb82436d">
  <data key="d3">Once the two-year contestability window has passed, the insurer cannot use prior misrepresentations as grounds to deny claims, rendering earlier conditions irrelevant.</data>
  <data key="d4">consequence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="4ba5aa3e-d14a-4e24-9784-1bfc938f9518">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period has expired, insurers lose the right to challenge the policy's validity based on prior misrepresentations, rendering earlier conditions irrelevant.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="b418554b-6c94-4f40-8a92-5c7ae9e4a969">
  <data key="d3">Sentence 1 establishes a general rule about non-contestability post-period, while sentence 2 introduces a key exception based on fraud, thereby refining the initial claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="20a49319-596a-4eb4-9cf6-c48e01ba5bb2">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that the insurer loses the right to dispute policy validity after the contestability period ends. Fact_sentence_2 strengthens this by explicitly stating that even misstatements do not permit contestation, clarifying the scope of protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.98</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">The end of the first contestability period allows continued policy validity unless the policy is later reinstated, at which point a new contestability period begins. Reinstatement effectively overrides prior expiration of the contestability clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">The end of the original contestability period allows the policy to remain valid unless challenged earlier, but when reinstated, a new contestability window starts solely for reinstatement-related claims, maintaining consistency with the clause’s intent.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional reset</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="78b5d060-8134-489f-89c3-41f10e3bdf1b">
  <data key="d3">The end of the contestability period removes the insurer’s ability to dispute claim validity, allowing the full death benefit to be paid without restriction due to prior misrepresentations.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="7c0199b7-ab48-4404-96ba-e4cf6a976f54">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of the contestability period ensures that the policy remains valid; however, if the insured dies by suicide within two years of reinstatement—even after the original contestability period has passed—the benefit obligation is restricted to premium returns. This limitation applies specifically when reinstatement renews the two-year suicide exclusion window.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of the contestability period ensures that the insurer can no longer invalidate the policy, allowing the full death benefit to become available after two years post-reinstatement, assuming all other terms are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of the contestability period ensures long-term policy stability, enabling reinstatement only if new medical evidence confirms insurability. This supports continuity of coverage despite lapses.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b">
  <data key="d3">The end of the contestability period prevents the insurer from invalidating the policy based on misrepresentation, but reinstating a lapsed policy requires fulfilling specific conditions, such as submitting a formal application, thereby allowing the company to potentially resume contestability rights under new circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period has expired, the insurer loses the right to dispute the policy’s validity, allowing for lawful reinstatement under the stated conditions. This ensures that reinstated policies retain full legal standing from the point of restoration.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">The end of the contestability period ensures long-term stability of the policy’s validity, but reinstatement overrides this protection by resetting certain restrictions like the suicide clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of the initial contestability period establishes a permanent protection against invalidation, enabling policies to be reinstated without risk of future challenges based on prior misrepresentations. This sets the stage for a renewed contestability window upon reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period ends, the policy becomes fully enforceable, but until reinstatement occurs, the insurer remains unliable for claims arising before that point. This reflects how legal protections shift upon reinstatement despite earlier stability.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="1ca6911d-df92-4ae4-b6bb-99a8272cae42">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year contestability period—triggered by the policy's issue date—means that any claims filed before August 1, 2027, could potentially be contested, making the issue date crucial for assessing claim eligibility under this clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1" target="6027da96-db64-41d1-9b1e-c3ef1d338bd7">
  <data key="d3">The conclusion of the contestability period, governed by timing relative to the issue date, depends on counting policy anniversaries to identify when two years have passed since inception.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
