  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="0c2827a9-0e3d-4777-bd94-129e200c0a71">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="2ccc2a1b-cdc3-45ef-9eca-fa939da40950">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy restarts the two-year countdown for incontestability and removal of suicide exclusions, effectively overriding prior timelines established at issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">resets period</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 relies on the reset of the two-year contestability window described in fact_sentence_1, ensuring that full benefits are paid only after the new two-year period expires following reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="3f3c482f-63c7-4446-b46e-136dbb82436d">
  <data key="d3">The availability of full death benefits after two years post-reinstatement hinges on having survived the renewed contestability period initiated at reinstatement, which includes scrutiny for prior misrepresentations.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts period</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="4ba5aa3e-d14a-4e24-9784-1bfc938f9518">
  <data key="d3">Once the policy has been reinstated and at least two years have passed since reinstatement, the prior contestability rules no longer apply, meaning any previous misrepresentations would no longer justify denial of the full death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period has passed, the policyholder’s coverage is protected, making it possible for the full death benefit to be paid out after two years from reinstatement without being restricted by prior misrepresentations.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="20a49319-596a-4eb4-9cf6-c48e01ba5bb2">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period has expired post-reinstatement, the policyholder gains protection ensuring the full death benefit is paid out, assuming all other terms are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="b418554b-6c94-4f40-8a92-5c7ae9e4a969">
  <data key="d3">Once the contestability period ends (excluding fraud), the policyholder gains protection ensuring that after two years from reinstatement, the full death benefit is payable irrespective of the cause of death, reinforcing the finality of the initial clause’s time-based limitation.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">The eligibility for full death benefit after two years post-reinstatement relies directly on the start of a fresh contestability clock initiated upon reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">Once two years have passed since reinstatement, the restriction imposed by the renewed contestability period ends, meaning the insurer can no longer deny claims based on prior misrepresentations in the reinstatement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="890edb7e-d6f7-49a2-af24-7d3844f90821">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy triggers a reset of the two-year suicide exclusion period; thus, even though initial suicide within two years limits payment to premiums, future eligibility for full benefits hinges on surviving beyond two years after reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="7c0199b7-ab48-4404-96ba-e4cf6a976f54">
  <data key="d3">After two years from reinstatement, the prior restriction on suicide-related payouts no longer applies, allowing full benefit payment even if death was due to suicide.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="78b5d060-8134-489f-89c3-41f10e3bdf1b">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 specifies that the full death benefit is available two years after reinstatement. This condition mirrors the timeline set forth in fact sentence 1 for newly issued policies, showing how the rules apply equally across initial issuance and reinstatement scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to initial issue as well</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becomes payable two years after reinstatement only if the reinstatement process was successfully begun through a written application.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8">
  <data key="d3">The eligibility to receive the full death benefit after two years post-reinstatement depends on first being able to reinstate the policy within five years of lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becomes payable after two years post-reinstatement only if the policy has been successfully reinstated, which requires demonstrating insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="a00154a8-e11a-439a-bed6-5a4409f0f383">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becomes payable after two years post-reinstatement only if the policyholder satisfies reinstatement conditions, such as paying overdue premiums with interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becoming payable after two years post-reinstatement relies on the policy being treated as active again, which requires reinstatement to restore its legal status.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becomes available after two years post-reinstatement only once the new contestability period has expired, ensuring compliance with the policy’s conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">The full death benefit becoming available after two years post-reinstatement depends on the reactivation of the suicide exclusion period beginning at reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec">
  <data key="d3">After two years from reinstatement, the full death benefit becomes available, but only for causes of death occurring after reinstatement; liabilities before reinstatement remain unenforceable.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="b32da2b1-a458-4c5b-bb4d-0cd663f0dd82">
  <data key="d3">The two-year window for full death benefit payout beginning at reinstatement depends on the Incontestability provision being reset, making it conditional on the timing initiated by reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="17de4c88-376a-4e6b-b992-7f89cc84bb9a">
  <data key="d3">Following reinstatement, the suicide exclusion begins again, but once two years have passed, the prior limitation ceases to apply, aligning with the full benefit availability stated here.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts after</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd" target="91d5242d-2ab5-43dd-a6c9-1df492a48caf">
  <data key="d3">Once the two-year reinstatement period elapses per fact_sentence_2, the condition for full benefit availability is met, allowing the provisions in fact_sentence_1 regarding estate payouts to take effect without limitation.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
