  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy renews its effective status, thereby restarting the two-year contestability clock mentioned in the first sentence, though the initial condition remains unchanged otherwise.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">A policy’s eligibility to be reinstated allows for the renewal of its terms, including the reactivation of the two-year contestability clause effective from the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy within five years enables the start of a fresh two-year contestability period based on the reinstatement application's content.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="7c0199b7-ab48-4404-96ba-e4cf6a976f54">
  <data key="d3">The eligibility to reinstate a lapsed policy, as stated in fact_sentence_2, creates the temporal framework necessary for the suicide clause in fact_sentence_1 to apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy within five years allows the clock to start ticking toward qualifying for the full death benefit after two years from reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">preconditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years depends on fulfilling specific requirements, such as providing a written application for reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years depends on providing acceptable proof of the insured's current health status. Without such evidence, reinstatement cannot occur even if within the timeframe.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="a00154a8-e11a-439a-bed6-5a4409f0f383">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years depends on fulfilling specific financial conditions, such as paying overdue premiums with interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="2f7c6575-4d94-4771-9874-466c56019468">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement of a lapsed policy requires payment of overdue premiums with accrued interest, which compounds annually according to policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d3">The ability to reinstate a lapsed policy within five years leads directly to its treatment as if it were continuously in force, restoring full contractual validity upon compliance with requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement after a lapse resets the contestability period, ensuring that any potential misrepresentations made before the lapse do not affect coverage post-reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy restarts its effective terms, but the insurer remains exempt from responsibilities incurred before the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy resets the suicide exclusion period, meaning the two-year waiting period starts again from the reinstatement date rather than the original policy issuance date.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
