<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="2ccc2a1b-cdc3-45ef-9eca-fa939da40950">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement is necessary when reviving a lapsed policy, even though the original incontestability timeline remains unaffected until the new effective date begins.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement enables the restoration of the policy’s active status; however, doing so restarts the contestability period, meaning the protection granted by the expiration of the original contestability period no longer applies once reinstatement occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">reactivates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement triggers the potential start of a new two-year contestability period under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement triggers the start of a new contestability period based solely on the reinstatement application’s content.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="7c0199b7-ab48-4404-96ba-e4cf6a976f54">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application initiates the reinstatement process, which may lead to the activation of new contestability and suicide exclusion periods, thereby enabling the conditions under which fact_sentence_1 applies.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">A written application for reinstatement is required before the two-year clock starts ticking toward eligibility for the full death benefit upon death.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement is a prerequisite that allows the policyholder to exercise the right to reinstate a lapsed policy within the five-year window.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application initiates the reinstatement process, after which the applicant must provide evidence that the insured remains insurable.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="a00154a8-e11a-439a-bed6-5a4409f0f383">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a written application for reinstatement sets the procedural stage, after which the financial condition of paying overdue premiums with interest becomes applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement initiates the process that results in the policy being treated as continuously in force from the original effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement initiates the process that leads to the policy being restored, thereby triggering a fresh two-year contestability window beginning at the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement initiates the process that resets key policy terms, including the suicide exclusion period effective from the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="2f7c6575-4d94-4771-9874-466c56019468">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a written application for reinstatement sets the stage for initiating the reinstatement process, while the compounding of interest applies to any outstanding premium payments required at that time.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b" target="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written application for reinstatement triggers the formal process that leads to the restoration of coverage. After reinstatement, the company assumes responsibility for future obligations, excluding those predating the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
