  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="ceb8d8c4-f2a8-447d-b6f4-91c549089116">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="671f6e00-2e4a-4791-a659-54e06d1e823e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">concept</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="2ccc2a1b-cdc3-45ef-9eca-fa939da40950">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy restores it to active status as if uninterrupted; therefore, the original two-year contestability period begins again from the date of reinstatement, aligning with the condition stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="b1209a03-debc-41d3-aa0a-edcc152854fd">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy resets its effective status, meaning the original contestability timeline begins again, reinforcing the conditions outlined in fact_sentence_1 about what makes the policy incontestable over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="3f3c482f-63c7-4446-b46e-136dbb82436d">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy restores its legal standing as active from the original effective date. This reset affects how past issues such as misrepresentation might still trigger contestability, especially when new eligibility windows begin.</data>
  <data key="d4">restarts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="4ba5aa3e-d14a-4e24-9784-1bfc938f9518">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy restores it as if it were never terminated, effectively resetting the start time for the two-year contestability period described in the prior statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers reset</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="76e38f97-59cf-4de6-8497-dce31eec92a1">
  <data key="d3">When a policy is reinstated, it is considered continuously effective since inception, implying its initial validity—including the conclusion of the contestability period—is preserved and recognized retroactively.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="20a49319-596a-4eb4-9cf6-c48e01ba5bb2">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a policy restores its legal standing as active, effectively resetting protections such as the end of the contestability period. Therefore, the ability to avoid future contests depends on whether the new contestability period—initiated at reinstatement—has expired.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="b418554b-6c94-4f40-8a92-5c7ae9e4a969">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy resets its effective date to when originally issued, thereby reinitiating the contestability clock; thus, any pre-lapse misstatements could again become grounds for denial if discovered before the renewed two-year period ends.</data>
  <data key="d4">triggers reconsideration</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="fa298b78-ed8c-4e0c-bf92-26cf2ce452f8">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s restoration to active status after reinstatement enables the application of revised terms, including initiating a new contestability period effective from the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="311d56b0-6554-4971-9166-302d2fb46b50">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy as if it never lapsed creates the condition under which a fresh contestability window may apply solely to reinstatement-related disclosures.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="890edb7e-d6f7-49a2-af24-7d3844f90821">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy restores its original status, effectively resetting the two-year suicide exclusion window, so the earlier suicide clause becomes applicable once more after reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="7c0199b7-ab48-4404-96ba-e4cf6a976f54">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement revives the policy as if uninterrupted, thus initiating new eligibility windows—including the suicide exclusion—governed by the original policy timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="78b5d060-8134-489f-89c3-41f10e3bdf1b">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy treats it as continuously in effect, meaning any previously expired protections—including the two-year threshold for full death benefit payout—are reset, making fact_sentence_1 applicable again based on the new start date.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="6364d71d-2969-4592-8deb-8bc2dc62cbbd">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy so it is considered "in full force" allows the two-year contestability and suicide exclusion periods to begin anew, enabling eligibility for full benefits thereafter.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy after meeting conditions results in the policy being considered legally active from inception, effectively nullifying the lapse event retroactively.</data>
  <data key="d4">result of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b">
  <data key="d3">The consequence of treating the policy as if it never lapsed depends on having submitted a formal application for reinstatement, making the procedure essential to achieving this legal status.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">Restoring the policy to full force depends on submitting acceptable proof of the insured's current insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="a00154a8-e11a-439a-bed6-5a4409f0f383">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s reactivation as if uninterrupted relies on satisfying the prerequisite of paying past-due premiums with interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables reactivation</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="2f7c6575-4d94-4771-9874-466c56019468">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy as if it never lapsed implies continuity of rights and obligations, including the obligation to pay accrued interest on past-due premiums under the original terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="e8364bc1-ea45-49ba-a605-1c2c3dd2dd6c">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy renews its legal standing as active, allowing the application of fresh conditions such as the suicide exclusion period beginning again from the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy treats it as continuously active since inception, but the insurer remains exempt from liability for claims or obligations incurred before the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">exempts</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c" target="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy reestablishes its validity retroactively, but this restoration also initiates a fresh two-year contestability window beginning on the reinstatement date.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c8476fa1-a851-413f-b031-ca2032d9f6df" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is restored upon reinstatement</data>
</edge>
<edge source="23e6d16e-8c0c-4773-8a91-b2d5d4f69e92" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">reinstates the policy</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3ad6498a-6109-4c71-9a4b-a8ba7871c2ca" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">benefits from the restored policy</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d59ba12a-0231-4a4c-aef3-19ccae4f2f21" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">holds interest in the restored policy</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1234a587-62ac-4856-ba95-aa77322034dc" target="a02029bc-d32a-41e0-a806-f525ebfc428c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">caused lapse leading to reinstatement</data>
</edge>
