<edge source="c8a217fc-b379-48eb-80d2-edc84b27f3c5" target="2ccc2a1b-cdc3-45ef-9eca-fa939da40950">
  <data key="d3">Reinstatement of a lapsed policy initiates a new two-year contestability period, effectively resetting the protection offered under the original incontestability rule established at the time of issue.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
