<edge source="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec" target="dae46bf4-aa0b-48e8-8a30-9eb5461df3a8">
  <data key="d3">The limitation on pre-reinstatement liability depends directly on the occurrence of policy reinstatement, making the timing of reinstatement crucial.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec" target="7cd9fba9-62dc-4347-a278-9463dcb7691b">
  <data key="d3">Because the company is not liable for pre-reinstatement obligations, it necessitates a formal request like a written application to establish when new responsibilities commence, ensuring clarity on the start of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec" target="aecb2c75-f016-41ec-b85e-1fcb7b055c96">
  <data key="d3">Because the company excludes liability for pre-reinstatement obligations, submitting proof of insurability becomes necessary to establish a clean start under the renewed policy.</data>
