  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9849a0f2-a835-4ab0-9793-62acf42df5ec" target="a00154a8-e11a-439a-bed6-5a4409f0f383">
  <data key="d3">Because the insurer is not liable for pre-reinstatement obligations, it necessitates that full premium payments with interest be made to initiate reinstatement, ensuring the policyholder bears the cost of restoring coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
