  <data key="d3">Because the insurer assumes no obligation for claims before reinstatement, the accumulated interest on past-due premiums becomes relevant only after reinstatement takes effect, making repayment conditional on future liability.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on interest</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
