<edge source="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">The start of a new contestability period upon reinstatement assumes the policy remains non-auto-renewing, so any coverage extension depends on explicit action. Without automatic renewal, reinstatement becomes a distinct event triggering fresh terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
