  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 explains that claims are invalid during a policy lapse, meaning no benefits apply even if death results from causes like suicide. Fact_sentence_1 adds that suicide-related deaths are also excluded—but only within the initial two-year contestability window—even if the policy remains active.</data>
