<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the deadline for conversion depends on being within the allowed timeframe post-reinstatement, which aligns with the initiation of the new contestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the conversion deadline ensures continued coverage potential after a lapse, even though the company remains exempt from paying claims during the inactive period.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy lacks automatic renewal, timely submission of a conversion request becomes essential, making adherence to the stated conversion period critical.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a conversion request within the designated period enables the policyholder to exercise their prior eligibility under the terms of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="82a10084-3f57-48dc-9e6f-f24c360934c3">
  <data key="d3">To exercise the option of converting without evidence of insurability, the insured must submit the request within the time frame established by the policy’s conversion period.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to submit a conversion request within the designated window enables access to the new policy, which in turn necessitates adherence to its premium payment terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">preconditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies when the conversion request must be submitted, and fact_sentence_2 adds that the insured must meet an upper age threshold at the time of submission. Both conditions together determine whether conversion is permitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">For the conversion request to be successfully made, it must occur during the designated conversion period; the company’s obligation to deliver notices to the policy owner's last known address ensures that the policyholder receives timely information necessary to meet this deadline.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent life insurance depends on meeting timing requirements, including being within the conversion period, even if the policy has been reinstated afterward. Reinstatement alone does not guarantee eligibility for conversion beyond the stated deadline.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Conversion eligibility depends on remaining active during the conversion period; failure to pay premiums within the 31-day grace period may cause a lapse, thereby invalidating future conversion attempts even if otherwise qualified.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d3">Conversion eligibility depends on acting within a set timeframe; failing to do so could result in loss of opportunity even if the policy was still technically active via the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">Conversion to permanent insurance is contingent upon acting during the designated window; missing it means losing the right even if the policy remains technically active through grace periods.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">If the policy lapses, conversion becomes impossible; therefore, the condition of ongoing coverage described in fact_sentence_1 determines whether the conversion opportunity in fact_sentence_2 remains viable.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
