<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="b9fe7b83-3289-4ba8-a3cc-baa39c04ae61">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">statement</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="8e9b8afb-99c7-4764-886a-5f7e1454a72d">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">amendment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="e6176a38-fa5c-446a-993d-42f5ec5b2bf3">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">data</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="e484721d-4b1d-4ec2-a4d5-9c91d75fa8dd">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">law</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="6833f339-0f0e-4a49-a716-23b8ee0bed50">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">provision</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">Even though a new contestability period begins upon reinstatement, the right to convert to permanent life insurance hinges on being below the company's maximum conversion age at the time of application, making age a limiting factor independent of the contestability timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured not exceed the maximum conversion age applies specifically in the context where the policy has ended its term and lacks automatic renewal, meaning conversion becomes necessary rather than optional.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">Being under the maximum conversion age is a prerequisite for the policy owner’s eligibility to convert the policy before the expiry date.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="82a10084-3f57-48dc-9e6f-f24c360934c3">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the maximum conversion age requirement enables the insured to exercise the option to convert without providing evidence of insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 sets an age cap on conversion eligibility, which applies only if the request is made during the designated conversion period described in fact_sentence_1. Without meeting the timeframe, the age restriction becomes irrelevant.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The age limitation for conversion is part of the policy's enduring provisions that remain effective under applicable law.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">A prerequisite for reinstatement is that the insured remains below the maximum conversion age set by the company, which constrains the applicability of the reinstatement provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the maximum conversion age requirement is essential for initiating conversion, but it cannot be fulfilled if the policy has lapsed due to unpaid premiums beyond the 31-day grace period, making timely payment crucial for maintaining access to conversion options.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the maximum conversion age requirement is essential for initiating conversion; however, even if eligible, the process may fail unless premiums are paid promptly to avoid lapsing during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.78</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the maximum conversion age requirement enables potential policy conversion, but only if premiums have been kept current—or within grace period—to avoid lapsation.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">To avoid losing the right to convert to permanent insurance, the insured must act before exceeding the maximum conversion age. Failure to maintain coverage via timely premium payments causes a lapse, nullifying this option entirely.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
</edge>
<edge source="76d319e3-3d73-423f-9ccd-fb1749b53296" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has conversion age restriction</data>
</edge>
<edge source="acfaa0e5-d6a0-455c-969e-abb8fbd6e40e" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is timeframe for determining eligibility of conversion</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aba96071-5892-4b70-8b78-72b47b98ff9c" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is contingent upon meeting the age requirement set by the company</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bfdd307f-5abf-4a5e-9885-443e1617e926" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">sets the maximum conversion age</data>
</edge>
<edge source="266f1788-6bd1-4d4a-a74a-3458b7c05001" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">must be younger than or equal to the maximum conversion age</data>
</edge>
<edge source="62da9786-a221-40ad-98a5-06e08bca187f" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">defines the window during which conversion requests can be made</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2b114f52-90c7-4b6c-8854-8662d91763c7" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">determines eligibility based on age</data>
</edge>
