  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">amendment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="6a1ccf0f-495e-4b84-8d41-3de9d3d58c28">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">data</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="d0bed2f4-b56a-40ec-ae47-edf4e2f8782c">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">law</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="81d27a0f-821a-4ab6-9821-4168169537e7">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">provision</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">Timely premium payments ensure the policy remains active, allowing the reinstitution of the two-year contestability period upon reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">Properly paying premiums maintains active coverage necessary for the suicide exclusion to apply; without ongoing payments, the policy would lapse again, nullifying the exclusion’s effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">Failure to pay premiums as required could result in policy lapse, thereby triggering the exclusion of liability for events occurring during that time, including potential claims related to suicide or death.</data>
  <data key="d4">prevents lapse</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums per the product’s terms only applies because the policy lacks automatic renewal, necessitating intentional continuation.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums under the converted policy only applies once the policy owner has exercised their right to convert it before the expiry date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="82a10084-3f57-48dc-9e6f-f24c360934c3">
  <data key="d3">Meeting the premium payment obligation is essential after conversion, regardless of whether proof of insurability was required initially.</data>
  <data key="d4">condition for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497">
  <data key="d3">Properly paying premiums under the new policy depends on having initiated the conversion request during the allowed time frame.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d3">Properly paying premiums per the product terms ensures that the company has accurate data to generate correct periodic statements about payment status and coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="da6699b0-8745-467d-acc5-a910c61481be">
  <data key="d3">The obligation to pay premiums according to the policy’s terms is preserved because periodic statements alone cannot override contractual provisions without official authorization.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums aligns with other continuing contract terms, reinforcing the idea that active compliance with financial duties supports the enforcement of existing policy conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="0dd1735c-ba92-4588-9e4a-6408b636a844">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy necessitates compliance with premium requirements specified by the product, ensuring continuity of coverage after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="6b3e96fb-fdf8-41b4-8cb5-c43de3bff2e7">
  <data key="d3">Consistent premium payments maintain policy continuity, ensuring the incontestability period applies meaningfully. Without current premiums, the policy could lapse, voiding protections including the incontestability clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="b0682bc0-a0b2-4059-b458-c16bdb0d9fb4">
  <data key="d3">Properly paying premiums maintains active coverage, ensuring that the suicide exclusion period remains enforceable under the policy terms described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="510725eb-a62d-4576-83ac-ca1422d3846e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes that premium payments must comply with the product's terms, which explicitly include the 31-day grace period mentioned in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="e877399f-ddc1-47c4-afa4-1ee3ff20f43e">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period where the policy stays in force relies on adherence to the premium payment schedule outlined in the product terms referenced in the second fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="49091360-e758-47e5-b0be-5075a6066a07">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums under the selected product’s terms exists precisely to avoid triggering the lapse condition outlined in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19" target="4f4b308d-6280-46d2-bd3f-7dd1c0a313ad">
  <data key="d3">Properly paying premiums per the product’s terms prevents policy lapse, thereby maintaining continuous coverage as outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ffb004fb-bb96-4948-93bd-a08c47b45cbf" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">governs payment requirements</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f2d7d0e3-84e2-4889-b4e7-630b5466ecec" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">requires payment of premiums</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d2312d40-6c84-4af4-b3bf-face92d6ad3d" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">sets payment terms for conversion</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3bfb9eca-f6a7-4854-ad0e-bc8322f4def9" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">responsible for making conversion payments</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3c3aa2ec-9bdb-496a-bf62-e38c6a28716e" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">subject to payment obligation if not owner</data>
</edge>
<edge source="46fd2177-7afa-4e38-b76c-0c581e0bf890" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">defines timeframe for compliant premium payment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7348c626-26cb-4cca-9909-5774e5e9613d" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
