</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="effe3ea6-daae-4c03-b44b-e751e10ea2f2">
  <data key="d3">Proper notice delivery rules, such as requiring company direction for non-standard addresses, operate within the jurisdictional framework established by New York law, ensuring consistency with statutory and contractual expectations.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="8dcdc8e2-1f45-4998-84dc-c7db4250fe35">
  <data key="d3">If the Company permits, notices may bypass the default Administrative Office route. Otherwise, they must follow the prescribed address.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets a condition limiting where notices can be delivered unless overridden by the company; fact_sentence_2 describes the default method used by the company when sending notices, relying on the most current address stored in its records.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d3">If the Policy Owner fails to inform the company of an address change, they risk missing important notices, even if alternative delivery methods were permitted. Therefore, updating contact information enables effective communication per the notice rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="da6699b0-8745-467d-acc5-a910c61481be">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 sets forth requirements for delivering notices, emphasizing adherence to company-directed methods. This supports the principle in fact_sentence_2 that only formally authorized changes can amend the policy, maintaining control over contractual modifications.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for proper notice delivery supports the enforcement of contractual obligations, ensuring that communications align with policy rules. Remaining provisions staying effective reinforces the continuity of legal commitments even after changes or lapses.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
