  <data key="d4">amendment</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="f5278c49-0193-4969-97db-6345581df5db">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">data</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="c644e71b-4418-47e8-8764-f27b27670e70">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">law</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="9d45cd0d-4b1a-4d04-812c-855bde35971e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">provision</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">Proper notice delivery to the policyowner’s last known address enables them to understand that the policy won’t renew automatically, allowing time to act on conversion options.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">Sending notices to the policyholder’s last known address enables them to become aware of their eligibility to convert the policy into permanent life insurance prior to expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="0c4d1411-9c02-4d7d-ae5c-767cd2ba2497">
  <data key="d3">Timely delivery of notices to the policy owner at their last known address facilitates awareness of the conversion period, allowing the policyholder to submit a conversion request before it expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="effe3ea6-daae-4c03-b44b-e751e10ea2f2">
  <data key="d3">Proper notice delivery to the policyowner’s last known address operates within the legal boundaries defined by New York law, ensuring enforceability and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="8dcdc8e2-1f45-4998-84dc-c7db4250fe35">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 explains how the Company delivers notices—to the last known address of the Policy Owner stored in its records. This complements fact_sentence_1 by defining the mechanism through which the Company responds or communicates back to the Policy Owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 outlines the standard practice for notice delivery based on the policyholder’s registered address; fact_sentence_1 adds an exception allowing alternate delivery points only upon explicit direction from the company.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforces condition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e">
  <data key="d3">The Company's practice of sending notices depends on having up-to-date personal information about the Policy Owner stored in its records.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d3">The company relies on accurate address records to deliver notices effectively, making it essential that the policy owner updates their address when necessary.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d3">Notice delivery via the last known address enables the company to effectively transmit periodic statements about coverage and payments. Without reliable notification methods, timely updates could fail to reach the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df">
  <data key="d3">Notice delivery procedures involve using the Policy Owner’s last known address, which may include sensitive personal details. Ensuring such data remains confidential supports compliance with privacy standards tied to communication practices.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="7d071894-fa6e-4785-b8ec-2151d38f49ed">
  <data key="d3">Notice delivery relies on accurate personal data being maintained, so sending communications to the last known address assumes that personal information has been collected and stored properly under privacy-compliant methods.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">Notice delivery via the last known address ensures that policyholders receive required communications, supporting the continued validity of other contract terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6e93e83-0aa2-437d-8728-8a7a1d727687" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">sends notices</data>
</edge>
