<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="8dcdc8e2-1f45-4998-84dc-c7db4250fe35">
  <data key="d3">The obligation to notify the company of an address change exists so that official communications can be correctly routed to the current address, ensuring receipt at the designated administrative office per policy rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to notify the company of an address change exists so that the company can deliver notices correctly, including through non-standard routes when authorized.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">If the policy owner fails to inform the company of an address change, the company may not successfully deliver important notices, potentially affecting rights or obligations under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d3">If the Policy Owner fails to update their address, they may miss important statements from the company, potentially leading to missed premiums or lack of awareness about coverage status.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s obligation to report address changes supports accurate maintenance of personal information by the Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594">
  <data key="d3">If the policy owner fails to inform the company of an address change, it may hinder effective communication, potentially affecting how personal information is managed and utilized.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="7d071894-fa6e-4785-b8ec-2151d38f49ed">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 mandates that the policyholder inform the company of address changes, supporting accurate recordkeeping. Fact sentence 2 confirms that such records are handled in accordance with privacy laws, reinforcing trust and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for the Policy Owner to report changes in address helps ensure that notices from the company are properly delivered, supporting the continued validity and enforceability of other policy provisions under applicable law.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="324d7365-ef13-4d05-9a63-b3c58d7b9734" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">requires notification of address changes by the policy owner</data>
</edge>
