<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements issued by the company help keep the policyholder informed about their coverage and payments, enabling them to assess whether they meet the criteria necessary for converting the policy to permanent life insurance.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements from the company help verify whether premiums have been paid correctly, supporting compliance with the requirement to pay premiums under the product terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">verifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="effe3ea6-daae-4c03-b44b-e751e10ea2f2">
  <data key="d3">Periodic notifications about coverage and payments operate within the legal boundaries set forth by New York law, ensuring compliance with statutory requirements and contract interpretation rules applicable to the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enforced by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements on coverage and premiums rely on accurate contact information; thus, sending such materials necessitates using the last known address stored in the system.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d3">Timely delivery of periodic statements depends on accurate contact information; thus, the Policy Owner’s prompt notification of address changes supports reliable communication from the company.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="da6699b0-8745-467d-acc5-a910c61481be">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements inform the insured about coverage and payments but lack binding authority over policy terms unless officially amended through a proper rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements require access to personal and financial details related to the policyholder’s account, necessitating prior collection and maintenance of such data.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa" target="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594">
  <data key="d3">Periodic statements about coverage and premiums require access to personal data, which is justified by its use in underwriting, claims processing, and administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b1ab7c7-9e19-4da5-a22b-b0c8856ea7e4" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is subject to periodic statement provision</data>
</edge>
