<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">Maintaining personal information allows the Company to reliably deliver required notices to the Policy Owner at their last known address.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d3">The Company’s collection and retention of personal information necessitates reliable contact details from the Policy Owner for effective communication.</data>
  <data key="d4">needs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d3">To issue timely statements about premiums and coverage, the company must collect and maintain personal information, making it foundational to delivering those communications.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df">
  <data key="d3">The collection of personal information by the company establishes a need for confidentiality to safeguard sensitive data. Therefore, maintaining confidentiality is a direct consequence of the data being gathered.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594">
  <data key="d3">The company collects personal information for policy-related functions, and this data is restricted to use in underwriting, claims processing, and administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">used for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="7d071894-fa6e-4785-b8ec-2151d38f49ed">
  <data key="d3">The policy involves collecting personal information, which necessitates adherence to relevant privacy laws. Compliance with those laws governs how the collected data may be used.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The collection of personal information is part of the broader set of provisions that remain effective under the policy’s governing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">part of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
