<edge source="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df" target="89be458d-91c9-451d-8e88-14357ccda4fd">
  <data key="d3">Confidentiality of personal information safeguards the integrity of communications, including those used to deliver notices to the Policy Owner at their last known address.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df" target="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e">
  <data key="d3">Confidentiality requirements exist because the company collects personal information; thus, the protection of data depends on its initial collection under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df" target="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594">
  <data key="d3">Confidentiality ensures that personal information remains protected from unauthorized access; this safeguard supports its intended use in underwriting, claims processing, and administrative functions.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df" target="7d071894-fa6e-4785-b8ec-2151d38f49ed">
  <data key="d3">The commitment to keep personal information confidential is supported by adherence to applicable privacy laws and regulations, ensuring that confidentiality aligns with legal standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">justified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
