<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="d026a2f0-fa01-44c1-91bc-9263e9ca7e95">
  <data key="d3">Properly managing personal information relies on up-to-date contact details so that notices and communications reach the policy owner efficiently.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="1fb212bb-16a8-42fb-a936-31c2b2fbbbaa">
  <data key="d3">Information used for underwriting, claims, and admin purposes necessitates regular updates communicated via periodic statements to maintain transparency.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="4c260448-0068-4d44-ba1c-cf625ed7012e">
  <data key="d3">The limitation on using collected personal information exclusively for underwriting, claims, and administrative tasks implies that such data is gathered specifically to support those activities.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits use of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="f932947d-216a-4831-b8cd-e81d49f393df">
  <data key="d3">Using personal information only for specified purposes such as underwriting and claims necessitates maintaining confidentiality to prevent misuse or exposure.</data>
  <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="7d071894-fa6e-4785-b8ec-2151d38f49ed">
  <data key="d3">The use of personal information for underwriting, claims, and administration aligns with legal requirements, ensuring adherence to privacy laws.</data>
  <data key="d4">justified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b421cb1f-dcdd-48c3-a194-ed048156b594" target="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563">
  <data key="d3">The use of personal information for underwriting and claims aligns with broader contract provisions that persist unless invalidated by law.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
