<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="a68f05ee-b6c2-4a27-be1f-bfafeddf4b0c">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of policy provisions enables the enforcement of specific terms like the reactivation of the contestability period, ensuring procedural consistency post-reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="e9992b58-f0cb-4309-aa8b-99ccf5ca595c">
  <data key="d3">The continued enforceability of policy provisions enables the reinstated suicide exclusion to take effect once the new contestability period begins after reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="e6c3a70b-5a82-471d-8ba5-5360ade9eb6b">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of other contract provisions supports the specific rule that the company remains exempt from liability during the lapse period.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="2c93e604-74f7-4280-8c64-064a764c03c7">
  <data key="d3">Even though the policy doesn’t renew automatically, its ongoing validity depends on whether any provisions survive according to legal standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="be5d9596-fd48-4642-93c3-1033cc1a3da6">
  <data key="d3">The persistence of key policy provisions enables the enforcement of the conversion right described in the earlier statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="82a10084-3f57-48dc-9e6f-f24c360934c3">
  <data key="d3">The persistence of remaining provisions enables the continuation of special rights like conversion without evidence of insurability, maintaining the policy’s intended flexibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="cf26351d-1aa6-446d-8320-a1b56d723009">
  <data key="d3">The continuation of policy provisions ensures that conditions like the maximum conversion age remain binding and enforceable.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="6b3c39b6-2af6-4210-bf69-47e128370b19">
  <data key="d3">Continuing validity of policy provisions implies that premium payment requirements remain binding, ensuring consistency across operational and legal aspects of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">implied by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="effe3ea6-daae-4c03-b44b-e751e10ea2f2">
  <data key="d3">Since some provisions remain effective under applicable law, it is necessary that the policy be governed by New York law to ensure consistent legal interpretation and enforcement.</data>
  <data key="d4">required by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="6c958eff-bcba-442c-aeee-865d50cfdb4e">
  <data key="d3">Even though the primary focus of the first sentence is venue selection, it remains applicable because the policy’s surviving provisions—including choice-of-law and jurisdiction clauses—stay in effect per the second sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="c5189b85-3b6b-486e-aed3-92e4fdeec68a">
  <data key="d3">The persistence of other provisions under law enables the enforcement of alternative dispute resolution mechanisms, such as resolving disputes outside New York courts when mandated by law.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
