  <data key="d3">The general continuation of contract terms enables the enforcement of specific requirements like sending notices to the administrative office.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="aa0a0cc0-c8ca-4da9-83d8-db6b05142910">
  <data key="d3">Even when specific procedures like notice delivery apply, the broader legal framework remains intact, preserving the binding nature of unexpired terms regardless of procedural specifics.</data>
  <data key="d4">underpins</data>
