<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="00afa11e-1a32-400d-a440-38b9111578d0">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 supports the idea that even after invalidation, remaining provisions endure; fact_sentence_2 provides the formal mechanism ensuring such survival via severability, making it legally robust.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
