<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="66d34f7f-f03b-44b9-ae46-16416415bc2a">
  <data key="d3">The persistence of policy provisions under law relies on formal compliance; thus, any attempt to waive such terms must follow the requirement for written authorization outlined here.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3063337b-6bf5-4d8f-be93-1c56bd525563" target="a2f514f9-483a-46e4-bd60-a528a1b42c8b">
  <data key="d3">The persistence of policy effectiveness after lapses depends on adherence to formal procedures; thus, continued enforcement of terms relies on documented actions such as authorized waivers.</data>
