  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 exemplifies the functional application of the policy terms it seeks to protect, demonstrating why clauses like severability and explicit waiver requirements are essential for maintaining enforcement stability.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on contractual terms</data>
