  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 broadens the implication of fact_sentence_1 by asserting that lack of action regarding one provision cannot be interpreted as waiving rights related to others, thereby supporting and expanding upon the narrower claim made in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">generalizes</data>
